  <para style="h">Adiyaara Yọọn</para>
  <para style="toc1">Adiyaara Yọọn</para>
  <para style="toc2">Adiyaara Yọọn</para>
  <para style="toc3">Adi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Adiyaara Yọọn</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ntọọñọ Ikọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Adiyaara a-atooho Yisọs Krais A-Abasi akenọọhọ anye adiwọt nditọufọk amọ mme ñkpọ se idiisọp itịppe. Ndin anye akenam ediọọñọ ñkpọ ami ke adinọ enyere amọ esọk mbed amọ Yọọn, <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />a-atieghe ntiense abaña afịd ñkpọ se anye akekịt, a-adooho ikọ Abasi ye ikọ ntiense Yisọs Krais. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Afọfọn anọ awo a-akoodo mme ikọ brọfesi ami ke akpọsọñ uyio, anyʌñ afọfọn anọ afịd awo e-ekoppo enyʌñ edat ikọ se ewet ami esịn ke awọñesịd ammọ, sia ini akpere.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Ekọọm ye Itooro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Ami Yọọn, nnọ etob ami esọk mme ufọkabasi itiaba e-ebaaha ke Esia. Yak mfọn ye emem aba ye ndufo, a-atooho anye a-abaaha, a-amaakebaba, a-adiinyʌñ itịmme idi, ato ñko mme sịbidịd itiaba e-ebaaha ke iso ebekpo amọ, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />anyʌñ ato Yisọs Krais anditie ntiense akpanikọ, akpa ke atu mme andised ke ñkpa ye Andikara ndidem ederimbod.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 1:5" />
  <para style="b" vid="REV 1:5" />
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Ubọọñ ye adudu enie anye i-imaaha ñnyịn, a-anyʌññọ adat iyiib amọ iyet ñnyịn asio ke ndiọiñkpọ, <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />ndin anam ñnyịn ido mme abioubọọñ ye mme aku adinam ñkpọ nnọọ Abasi ye Ete. Itooro ye adudu anie anye ke nsi-nsi nsi-nsi! Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />“Sese, anye asʌk adi ke ntọñanyọñ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">ndin “afịd anyen eyaekịt anye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 1:7">kpa ye mbon e-ekekịmme anye”;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">ndin afịd uduud awo ke isọñ “eyaefʌhọ ke ntak amọ.”</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:7">Ntoro ke adiido! Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Abọọñ Abasi atañ, “Ami ndo Alfa ye Omeka, a-abaaha, a-amaakebaba, a-adiinyʌñ itịmme idi, Andikponñkan.”<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Ñkukịd Yọọn A-abañake Krais</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Ami, Yọọn, ayịneka ye nsaña ndufo ke ewuana adibọ ukuud ke ntak abioubọọñ ye adiyọ ke ime a-adooho ake ñnyịn ke Yisọs, ñkeba ke isuọ Badmus ke ntak ikọ Abasi ye ntiense a-abañake Yisọs. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Ke Usen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ñkeba ke Sịbidịd, ndin mmaakop ataa ekamba uyio, nte uyio adukpoñ ke edem mmi <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />naña abo: <char style="wj">“Se afo akịt, wet ke ikpañwed, nyʌñ nọ esọk mme ufọkabasi itiaba e-ebaaha ke Efisọs, Simina, Pekamọm, Tiatira, Sadis, Filadelfia ye Laodisia.”</char><verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Ami mmaawọññọ anyen mbo nse uyio anditañ ikọ ye ami. Ndin ke mmaakewọññọ, mmaakịt mme udod utuenikañ kold itiaba, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />ndin ke atu mme udod utuenikañ itiaba ami awo amaada nte “ayịn awo,” asịne anyan nduọ-nduọ afọñ a-akenyọọñọ awuọ anye ñkpad, anyʌñ abọbọ ñkpaha ikpa ke ikpanesịd amọ. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Ided ke iwuod amọ akebit afia ided edọñ, asana nte sino, ndin ñkpasi anyen amọ akeyamma nte edeme ikañ. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />Ndin ñkpad amọ ekebit brọns e-esʌkkọ efọp ke ikañ, ndin uyio amọ akeba nte uyom akpainyañ. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Ke ubọk nnasia amọ anye amaakama ntantaafiọñ itiaba, ndin ke inua amọ anye amaafịbe anie iso iba eduad a-asọppọ eti-eti. Iso amọ akeyamma nte utịn a-ayammake ataa akpọsọñ-akpọsọñ.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Ke mmaakekịt anye, ami mmaaduọ ndoro anye ke ukod nte awo ñkpa. Ndin anye amaaben ubọk nnasia amọ andot miin anyʌñ abo, <char style="wj">“Kuukop ndịk. Ami ndo Akpa ye Akpatre.</char> <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" /><char style="wj">Ami ndo Aduuwem; ami mmaakpa, ndin idahami, ami mmedu ke nsi-nsi! Ami ñnyʌñ ñkama ukpọhọde ñkpa ye Abioekpo.</char><verse eid="REV 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />
    <char style="wj">“Wet, ndin, mme ñkpọ se afo akịt, mme ñkpọ se iba idahami ye mme ñkpọ se idiiba ke ini iso.</char> <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" /><char style="wj">Ndịbe-ndịbe ñkpọ a-abañake mme ntantaafiọñ itiaba a-afo akekịtte naña ensịne ke ubọk nnasia ye udod utuenikañ kold itiaba edo ami: Mme ntantaafiọñ itiaba edoñño mme enyere ufọkabasi itiaba ndin mme udod utuenikañ itiaba edoñño mme ufọkabasi itiaba.”</char><verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ñwed e-Enọọhọ Esọk Ufọkabasi ke Efisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />
    <char style="wj">Wet nọ enyere ufọkabasi ke Efisọs:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:1" />
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 2:1">
    <char style="wj">Anye ami ado mme ikọ anye a-akamake mme ntantaafiọñ itiaba ke ubọk nnasia anyʌñ asaña ke ufọọd udod utuenikañ kold itiaba.</char><verse eid="REV 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />
    <char style="wj">Ami mmediọọñọ utom mfo, ñwaidem ye ime a-afo anieghe. Ami mmediọọñọ ke afo ukanna uyọ mbon mbubịk, ndin afo amedomo mbon e-ebooho ke mmimọ idoñño mme abọsịd ado idoññoke, sia ammọ edo mbon abiaña.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" /><char style="wj">Afo amenie ime anyʌñ abọ ukuud ke ntak anyịñ mmi, ado ukpaaha mba.</char><verse eid="REV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />
    <char style="wj">Kpayeado, mmenie mfịna ye afo, sia afo amekpọñ akpa ima a-afo akenieghe.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" /><char style="wj">Kere baña naña afo aduọ asuuhọ akpọñ ñkoñ-ñkoñ idaha mfo! Kappa esịd nyʌñ tịmme kenam mme akpa utom a-afo akesinamma. Adieke afo umuukappake esịd, ami ñyaubịne fiin ñnyʌñ ndooro udod utuenikañ mfo nsio ke itie amọ. </char> <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" /><char style="wj">Ado e-ebat unọ fiin nte eti ñkpọ afo adisua ubọkutom mme Nikolaitan, a-ami nsuaaha ñko.</char><verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />
    <char style="wj">Awo akeedodo a-anieghe utọñ yak anye akop se Sịbidịd adọkkọ mme ufọkabasi. Awo a-akanna, ami ñyaanọ anye unen adidia nto mfịd eto uwem, a-abaaha ke paradais Abasi.</char><verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñwed e-Enọọhọ Esọk Ufọkabasi ke Simina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />
    <char style="wj">Wet nọ enyere ufọkabasi ke Simina:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:8" />
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 2:8">
    <char style="wj">Ami ado mme ikọ a-atooho anye a-adooho Akpa ye Akpatre, a-amaakekpa ndin atịmme adidu uwem.</char><verse eid="REV 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />
    <char style="wj">Ami mmediọọñọ ukuud mfo ye unana mfo, ado afo amenie inie! Mmediọọñọ mbaña adidọk mbon e-ebooho ke idoñño mme Yuu ke ini ammọ imiidoññoke, ado edoñño mboho Setan.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" /><char style="wj">Kuudịkke ubaña ukuud se afo uduubọ. Ami ntañ unọọ! Andidiọọk ayaadọñ usʌk ndufo ke ñkpakọb nọ idomo ndufo ese, ndin eyaebọ ndutʌhọ ke usen duob. Isọọñọ ida, akpekọm ado ke ñkpa, ndin ami ñyainọ ndufo uwem nte anyanya andikan.</char><verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />
    <char style="wj">Awo akeedodo a-anieghe utọñ yak anye akop se Sịbidịd adọkkọ mme ufọkabasi. Anye a-akanna idiibọọhọ ufen ndomokeed ito ayọhọ ñkpa iba.</char><verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñwed E-enọọhọ Esọk Ufọkabasi ke Pekamọm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />
    <char style="wj">Wet nọ enyere ufọkabasi ke Pekamọm:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:12" />
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 2:12">
    <char style="wj">Ami ado mme ikọ anye a-akamake nsọsọp eduad iso iba.</char><verse eid="REV 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />
    <char style="wj">Ami mmediọọñọ itie nte afo adʌñ, itie a-Setan anịmme ebekpo amọ. Ado afo amemʌm anyịñ mmi akama. Afo ukunyʌññọ ukañ mbuọdidem a-afo anieghe ke idem mmi, ukpọk ke ayio Antibas, ataa akpan ntiense mmi, e-ekewotto ke abio ndufo, itie idʌñ Setan.</char><verse eid="REV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />
    <char style="wj">Kpayeado, ami mmenie mfịna ifañ ye ndufo. Emenie ke ufọọd ndufo mbon e-esuuhọ iwuod enọ ukpeebñkpọ Balaam, a-akekpeebe Balak adikpak nditọ Isrel nọ enam idiọọkñkpọ ke adidia ndidia e-ewaaha enọ ndem, nsaña use, ñnyʌñ nsịn efịbe.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" /><char style="wj">Ndufo emenyʌñ enie mbon e-emʌmmọ ukpeebñkpọ mme Nikolaitan ekama.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" /><char style="wj">Ikappa esịd ndin! Imiidooho ntoro ami ñyaadi ibịne ndufo usọp-usọp ndinwana ye ammọ ye akañkañ a-atooho inua mmi.</char><verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />
    <char style="wj">Awo akeedodo a-anieghe utọñ yak anye akop se Sịbidịd adọkkọ mme ufọkabasi. Awo a-akanna, ami ñyaanọ anye usʌk ndedịbe mana. Ami ñyaanyʌñ nnọ awo ado afia itiad ye ufa anyịñ e-ewette ke itiad ado, a-adooho awo andibọ ikpọọñ adiidiọọñọ.</char><verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñwed E-enọọhọ Esọk Ufọkabasi ke Tiatira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />
    <char style="wj">“Wet nọ enyere ufọkabasi ke Tiatira:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:18" />
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 2:18">
    <char style="wj">Mme ikọ Ayịn Abasi, a-anyen amọ asakka nte akpọsọñ edemeikañ, i-ikpad amọ ebitte utọtʌk brọns edo ami.</char><verse eid="REV 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />
    <char style="wj">Ami mmediọọñọ mme utom mfo, ima ye mbuọdidem mfo; adinam ye ime mfo, ndin se afo anam idahami akpon akan ake akpa.</char><verse eid="REV 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />
    <char style="wj">Kpayeado, aba ñkpọ se ami ndat ubiom fiin ikpe. Afo ameyọ awonwaan ado, Yesibeel, a-akoodo idem amọ prọfed. Ato ke ukpeebñkpọ amọ, anye atịn mme mbed mmi usʌñ nọ esaña use, esịn efịbe, enyʌñ edia ndidia e-ewaaha enọ ndem. </char> <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" /><char style="wj">Ami mmenọ anye ufañ adikappa esịd ñkpọñ uwem use, ado anye inyịmmeke.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" /><char style="wj">Sese ami ñyaatop anye ndot ke ikʌk ukuud, ñnyʌñ nnam mbon e-esịnne efịbe ye anye eba ke ekamba ukuud, ibọhọke ammọ ekappa esịd ekpọñ ndiọi uwem ammọ.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" /><char style="wj">Ami ñyaawoot nditọ amọ. Ndin afịd mme ufọkabasi eyaediọọñọ ke ami ndo andiduuñọ akikere ye esịd, ndin ñyaanọ awo keedekeed ñkpọ ayịnutom ñkeene naña mme utom ammọ ebañña. </char><verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />
    <char style="wj">Ado ami idọkkọ ndufo mbon se isʌhọ ke Tiatira, ndufo e-esịnne ukpeebñkpọ amọ, i-imiinyʌññọ ikpeep se ammọ ekoot ntotəño ndịbe ifiọk Setan, ‘ami ndiinọọhọ ndufo ufen mfen ñkan ado,</char> <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" /><char style="wj">ibọhọke aditʌm mʌm se afo anie ñkama tutu ami ndi.’</char><verse eid="REV 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />
    <char style="wj">Ndin anye a-akanna anyʌñ anam uduak mmi tutu akesịm utịd, ami ñyaanọ anye adudu adikara mme idịd.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" /><char style="wj">Anye ‘ayaakara ammọ ye esañ ukwak, anyʌñ aboom ammọ ñkeñe-ñkeñe nte ñkpọ e-edommo ke mbad’ kpa naña ami mbọ adudu nto Ete Mmi. </char> <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" /><char style="wj">Ami ñyaanyʌñ nnọ anye ntantaafiọñ usiere.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" /><char style="wj">Awo akeedodo a-anieghe utọñ yak anye akop se Sịbidịd adọkkọ mme ufọkabasi.</char><verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ñwed E-enọọhọ Esọk Ufọkabasi ke Sadis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />
    <char style="wj">“Wet nọ enyere ufọkabasi ke Sadis:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:1" />
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 3:1">
    <char style="wj">Ami ado mme ikọ andikama sịbidịd Abasi itiaba ye ntantaafiọñ itiaba.</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:1" />
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 3:1">
    <char style="wj">Ami mmediọọñọ mme utom mfo. Afo amewuọ etob nte ke asʌk adu uwem, ado amekpa.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" /><char style="wj">Demme! Sọọñọ mme ñkpọ se isʌhọ e-eyemme adikpa, sia mmekịt ke utom mfo ikweeñeke ke iso Abasi mmi.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" /><char style="wj">Ndin toiyo se afo abọọ anyʌñ akop. Nekke anye kama nyʌñ tua ñkpọfiọk. Ado afo umuudemmeke, ami ñyaadi nte inọ, ndin afo uduudiọọñọke ini se ami ndiidi ubịne fiin.</char><verse eid="REV 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />
    <char style="wj">Kpayeado afo asʌk aneenie mme awo ifañ ke Sadis i-imiisappake afọñidem ammọ. Mbon ado eyaesaña ye ami, esịne mfia afọñidem, sia ammọ edot. </char> <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" /><char style="wj">Anye a-akanna ayaanyʌñ asịne afia afọñ nte ammọ. Ami ndiisọọhọ anyịñ awo ado nsio ke ñwed uwem tutu amama, ado ñyaabo ke mmediọọñọ anyịñ ado ke iso Ete mmi ye mme enyere amọ.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" /><char style="wj">Awo akeedodo a-anieghe utọñ yak anye akop se Sịbidịd adọkkọ mme ufọkabasi.</char><verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñwed E-enọọhọ Esọk Ufọkabasi ke Filadelfia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />
    <char style="wj">“Wet nọ enyere ufọkabasi ke Filadelfia:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:7" />
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 3:7">
    <char style="wj">Ami ado mme ikọ anye a-adooho adisana ye akpanikọ, anye a-akamake ukpọhọde Defid. Se anye atat awo ndomokeed ikanna ikọp, se anye anyʌñ akọp awo ndomokeed ikanna itat.</char><verse eid="REV 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />
    <char style="wj">Ami mmediọọñọ mme utom mfo. Sese, ami mmenịm anainwañ usʌñ ke iso mfo ake awo ndomokeed miidiikanna ikʌk. Mmedọdiọọñọ ke inweek mfo ikponno, ado afo amenịm ikọ mmi, unyʌññọ ukañ anyịñ mmi.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" /><char style="wj">Ami ñyaanam mbon e-edọñọke ke esob Setan, e-ebooho ke mmimọ idoñño mme Yuu, akpesʌkado ammọ idoññoke, ado edo mme asʌhọ nsu, ediduọññọ ke ukod mfo enyʌñ enyịmme anwa-anwa ke ami mmuma fiin.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" /><char style="wj">Sia afo amenịm ewʌhọ mmi ke adibọ ke ime, ami ñko ñyaumʌm fiin ñkama ke ini idomo a-adiisịm afịd ederimbod nọ adidomo mbon se idʌñ ke iso isọñ. </char><verse eid="REV 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />
    <char style="wj">Ami nsʌk nsọp ndi. Tʌm mʌm se afo anie kama, mbaak awo ndomokeed adubọọ anyanya mfo.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" /><char style="wj">Anye a-akanna, ami ñyaanam anye ado adaaha ke tembịd Abasi mmi. Ammọ idiikpọññọ do aba. Ami ñyaawet anyịñ Abasi mmi ke idem ammọ ye anyịñ ufa abio Abasi mmi, ufa Yeruselem, a-asọiyọke ke hefịn ato Abasi mmi adi. Ndin ami ñyaanyʌñ ñwet ufa anyịñ mmi ke idem ammọ.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" /><char style="wj">Awo akeedodo a-anieghe utọñ yak anye akop se Sịbidịd adọkkọ mme ufọkabasi.</char><verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñwed E-enọọhọ Esọk Ufọkabasi ke Laodisia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />
    <char style="wj">“Wet nọ enyere ufọkabasi ke Laodisia:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:14" />
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 3:14">
    <char style="wj">Anye ami ado mme ikọ andido Amen, andisọọñọnda ye ntiense akpanikọ, anye a-adooho andikara afịd se Abasi abot.</char><verse eid="REV 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />
    <char style="wj">Ami mmediọọñọ mme utom mfo, ke afo udeññekedeññe unyʌññọ ufofiop. Akpekapado afo ado keed ke atu ñkpọ iba ami.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" /><char style="wj">Ndin sia afo abaaha mmeme-mmeme, ufioppofiop unyʌññọ udedeññe, mmebeeñe idem adufiat fiin nsio ke inua mmi.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" /><char style="wj">Afo abo, ‘Ami mmenie inie; ami mmekọ uwak inie, ibaaha se ñyem.’ Ado afo udiọọñọke ke amenie mbọm, ado uweene ye nnan anyʌñ atie ifed.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" /><char style="wj">Ami unọ fiin item nte ambọ miin kold e-emaekenam ke ufiob ikañ adep nọ afo akappa ado anie ñkpọ; mbọ ñko afia afọñidem dep sịne nọ afʌk ifed ye asuenne mfo. Dep ibọk sịn ke anyen mfo nọ ato do afo amọọnọ ñkpọ.</char><verse eid="REV 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />
    <char style="wj">Mbon a-ami mmaaha ke ami nsua ñkpọ nnọ ñnyʌñ ntʌnọ. Ke ntoro, fọn ma nyʌñ kappa esịd.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" /><char style="wj">Ami mmọdo nda ke inuausʌñ nsʌk ñkọñ. Awo akeedodo a-akoppo uyio mmi anyʌñ akʌkkọ usʌñ annọ miin, ami ñyaadʌk ndidia ñkpọ ye awo ado, anye anyʌñ adia ye ami.</char><verse eid="REV 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />
    <char style="wj">Anye a-akanna, ami ñyaanọ anye unen aditie ye ami ke ebekpo ubọọñ mmi; kpa naña ami ñkekan ñnyʌñ ntie ye Ete mmi ke ebekpo ubọọñ amọ.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" /><char style="wj">Awo akeedodo a-anieghe utọñ yak anye akop se Sịbidịd adọkkọ mme ufọkabasi.”</char><verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ebekpo ke Hefịn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Ke mme ñkpọ ami amaakeboiyo mmaakịt naña usʌñ hefịn ana inwañ. Ndin akpa uyio añkekoppo a-akebaaha nte uyom ekamba adukpoñ amaambo miin ate, <char style="wj">“Saña dọọk di, yak ami uwọt fiin ñkpọ a-anaaha atịppe ke ini iso.”</char> <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Ini keed Sịbidịd amamben miin, ndin sese mmaakịt ebekpo ke abio Abasi, awo anyʌñ atie ke ebekpo ado. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Andikitie do akeba nte yaspa ye rubi. Adʌkabasi a-akebitte emeraal amaakanna ebekpo ado akʌk. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Ebekpo edịb mme inaañ emaekanna ebekpo ami ekʌk ndin ñkpisọñ edịb mme inaañ emaetie ke mme ebekpo ado. Ammọ ekesịne mfia afọñidem enyʌñ eyaara ntinya kold ke iwuod. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Amịneñmịneñ amaato ebekpo ami akeppe, asana ye ndukuunọ ye akpọsọñ uyio aduma. Ke iso ebekpo ami, utuenikañ itiaba ekesʌk esak. Afịd ami edo sịbidịd Abasi itiaba. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Ñko ke iso ebekpo ñkpọ se ikiiba nte ndukpọñ akpainyañ amaaba, amaayamma nte kristal.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Ndin ke ufọọd ebekpo mme ñkanñkʌk amọ akedo mme aduuwem ñkpọ inaañ, e-ekeyọhọke ye anyen ke iso ye ke edem. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Akpa aduuwem ñkpọ akeba nte ekpe, ayọhọ iba akeba nte abaakenañ, ayọhọ ita akenie iso nte awo, ayọhọ inaañ akeba nte ntrukpuum a-afuurọkefuurọ. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Ndin afịd mme aduuwem ñkpọ inaañ ami ekenieñe mba itiokeed, enyʌñ enieñe anyen eyọhọ idem, kpa ye ke idak mba ammọ. Uweemeayio ye akonayio ammọ ikiduọkkọ adudu ke edibo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">“ ‘Adisana, adisana, adisana</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Andikponñkan,’</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">a-amaakebaba, a-abaaha, a-adiitịmme adi.”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Ini akeedodo a-mme aduuwem ñkpọ ami enọọhọ anditie ke ebekpo a-aduuho uwem ke nsi-nsi ubọọñ, ukpono ye ekọọm, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />mme ñkpisọñ edịb mme inaañ ado eduọññọ ke isọñ ke iso anditie ke ebekpo enyʌñ ekpono anye a-aduuho uwem ke nsi-nsi. Ammọ ebon ntinya ammọ ke ebekpo enyʌñ ebo:<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye Abasi ñnyịn, afo amedot</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">adibọ ubọọñ ye ukpono ye adudu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">sia afo akebot afịd ñkpọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">ndin ke unyịmme mfo emaebot ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">ammọ enyʌñ enie uwem.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ikpañwed ye Ayịn Edọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Ndin ami mmaakịt ke ubọk nnasia anditie ke ebekpo, ikpañwed e-emaekewet ñkpọ ke naña edem iba, ekʌp enyʌñ efiik ke ufiikñkpọ itiaba. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Ndin ami mmaakịt ataa ekamba enyere keed naña abọọñ ke akpọsọñ uyio ate, “Anie idot adibom ufiikñkpọ itiaba ñnyʌñ ñkʌppọ ikpañwed ami?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Ado ikibaaha awo ndomokeed ke hefịn me ke isọñ me ke idakisọñ a-akekanna akʌppọ me adise esịd ñwed ado. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Ami mmaatua ataa eti-eti, sia ikibaaha awo ndomokeed a-akedotto adikʌppọ ikpañwed ado ñnyʌñ nse se isịne ke esịd. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Akem keed ke atu mme ñkpisọñ amambo miin ate, “Kuutua! Sese, Ekpe esiin Yuda, a-adooho adʌñ Defid a-akan. Anye a-akeme adikʌppọ ñwed ñnyʌñ mbom mme ufiikñkpọ itiaba ado.”<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Ndin mmaakịt Ayịn Edọñ a-akebaaha nte emaewoowot, naña ada ke ufọọd ebekpo, mme aduuwem ñkpọ inaañ ye ñkpisọñ eda ekanna anye ekʌk. Ayịn Edọñ ado akenie nnʌk itiaba ye anyen itiaba, e-edooho mme sịbidịd Abasi itiaba e-ekedọññọ nọ ewuọñọ eka ke afịd ederimbod. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Anye amaadi adisio ikpañwed ado ke ubọk nnasia andikitie ke ebekpo. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Ke anye amaakebọ ikpañwed ado, mme aduuwem ñkpọ inaañ ye mme ñkpisọñ edịb mme inaañ emaeduọññọ ke iso Ayịn Edọñ. Afịd ammọ keedekeed emaekaama ndido ye usan kold e-ekeyọhọke ye insensi e-edoññoke mme akam mme ndisana ikọd Abasi. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Ndin ammọ emaekwọ ufa ikwọ ete:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">“Afo amedot adibọ ikpañwed</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">amedot ñko adikʌppọ ufiikñkpọ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">sia emauwot fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">ndin afo amaadat iyiib mfo adep mme awo asio ke mme aduuk, ye usem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">ye uduud, ye idịd, ayaak anọ Abasi.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Afo amenam ammọ edoñño abioubọọñ ye mme aku, nọ enam utom Abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">ndin ammọ eyaekaara ke ederimbod.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Ndin ami mmaase ñnyʌñ ñkop uyio uwak mme enyere, ke tọsịn ke tọsịn mme tọsịn duob ke itie tọsịn duob. Ammọ emaekanna ebekpo ye mme aduuwem ñkpọ ye mme ñkpisọñ ekʌk. <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Ammọ emaekwọ ke akpọsọñ uyio ete:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">“Ayịn Edọñ e-emaekewot a-adot adibọ adudu ye inie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">ye ikike ye udịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">ye ukpono, ye ubọọñ ye itooro.”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Ndin ami mmaakop naña afịd ñkpọ se Abasi akebot ke hefịn ye ke ederimbod ye ke idakisọñ ye ke akpa mmọọñ ye afịd ñkpọ se isịne ke esịd ammọ ebo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">“Yak itooro ye ukpono ye ubọọñ ye adudu enie anye a-atieghe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">ke ebekpo anyʌñ anie Ayịn Edọñ,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:13">ke nsi-nsi, nsi-nsi!”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Mme aduuwem ñkpọ inaañ emaebọọrọ, “Amen,” ndin mme ñkpisọñ emaeduọññọ ke isọñ enọ ukpono.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Ufiikñkpọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Ami mmaase naña Ayịn Edọñ akʌppọ akpa ufiikñkpọ ke atu mme ufiikñkpọ itiaba ado. Ndin mmaakop naña keed ke atu mme aduuwem ñkpọ inaañ ado atañ ke uyio a-akebiotto aduma ate, “Di!” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Ami mmaase, ndin ñkịt naña afia enañmbakara ada ke iso mmi! Andidoro ke anye amaakama utịgha, emaenyʌñ enọ anye anyanya, anye anyʌñ awat awuọ nte uko ke ekọñ a-awuọhọ aka adikan ke ekọñ.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Ke Ayịn Edọñ amaakekʌppọ ufiikñkpọ ayọhọ iba, mmaakop naña aduuwem ñkpọ ayọhọ iba abo, “Di!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Ndin enañmbakara mfen, a-akedatta nte ekamba edeme ikañ, amaawuọ adi. Emaenọ andiwad anye adudu adiben emem nsio ke ederimbod ndin anam mme awo eduwotto idem ammọ. Emaenọ anye ataa ekamba akañkañ.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Ke ini Ayịn Edọñ amaakekʌppọ ayọhọ ufiikñkpọ ita, ami mmaakop naña aduuwem ñkpọ ayọhọ ita abo, “Di!” Ami mmaase ñnyʌñ ñkịt naña abubịd enañmbakara ada ke iso mmi! Andiwad anye akekama udomo ñkpọ iba ke ubọk amọ. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Ndin mmaakop ñkpọ a-abaaha nte uyio ato keed ke atu mme aduuwem ñkpọ inaañ ado abo, “Udomo abakpa iba ke akʌkutom usen keed, udomo baali itiokeed ke akʌkutom usen keed, ndin ikiibiat adan ye ukọd!”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Ke Ayịn Edọñ amaakekʌppọ ayọhọ ufiikñkpọ inaañ, mmaakop naña aduuwem ñkpọ ayọhọ inaañ abo, “Di!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Ami mmaase ñnyʌñ ñkịt naña iyeed-iyeed enañmbakara ada ke iso mmi. Anyịñ andiwad anye akedo Ñkpa, ndin Abioekpo amaasaña adiana anye ke edem. Emaenọ ammọ adudu adiwot ubeñ ederimbod keed ke itie inaañ ke akañkañ, ke akañ ye idiọọk udọñọ ye ndiọi unam ikọd ke ederimbod.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Ke anye amaakekʌppọ ufiikñkpọ ayọhọ ition mmaakịt ke idak itie uwa, ukpọñ mbon e-ekewotto ke ntak ikọ Abasi ye ikọ ntiense a-ammọ ekemʌmmọ ekama. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Ammọ emaebọọñ ke akpọsọñ uyio ebịp ete, “Adiikpeene die, Abọọñ Andikara, Adisana ye anam Akpanikọ, mbemiso Afo akpe ikpe afịd mme andidʌñ ke ederimbod anyʌñ asio usiene iyiib ñnyịn e-ekeduọkkọ?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Ndin emaenọ ammọ keedekeed afia afọñidem, enyʌñ ebo ammọ esʌk emaana ebet etək-etək tutu ewoot nọ akem ibad mme emọ-emọ mbed ye nditọeka ke Krais ammọ nana ekewoot ammọ.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Mmaase naña anye akʌppọ ufiikñkpọ ayọhọ itiokeed, ndin ekamba unyeñisọñ amaatịppe. Utịn amaakappa ado ekịm nte afọñ ikpo e-edatta ided ebod enam. Afiọñ amaakappa adat nte iyiib afịd-afịd, <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />ndin mme ntantaafiọñ emaeduọññọ eto ikpaanyọñ ebono ke isọñ naña mfịd fik asibeghe ke eto fik ke ini akpọsọñ afịm anyeeñeke anye. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Mme hefịn emaenwuuno nte ikpañwed anwuuno, emaenyʌñ ebenne afịd ñkpoon abod ye isuọ esịññe ke itie ammọ.<verse eid="REV 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Ndin mme ndidem ederimbod, mme nditọ mbọọñ, mme ñkpoon adaiso ekọñ, mme imọ awo, mme akop adudu ye mme ifʌn, mme afịd amanaisọñ emaedịbe ke mme aba ye ke idak itiad ke ñkpoon abod. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ ekoot mme ñkpoon abod ye itiad ebo, “Duọ ifʌk ñnyịn, nyʌñ idịp ñnyịn ke iso anditie ke ebekpo ye iyadesịd Ayịn Edọñ. <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Sia ekamba usen iyadesịd ammọ adikem, ndin anie idiikan ida?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Efiik Awo 144,000 Idiọọñọ ke Akpọiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Ke ami amaakeboiyo, ami mmaakịt mme enyere inaañ naña eda ke inuuk ederimbod inaañ, enyʌñ emʌm mme afịm e-etooho mbeñ inaañ ekama mbaak afịm ndomokeed adifịme ke isọñ me ke inyañ me ke eto ndomokeed. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Ndin ami mmaakịt enyere mfen naña ato ke usakkautịn adi, anyʌñ akama ufiikñkpọ aduuwem Abasi. Anye amaakoot ke akpọsọñ uyio mme enyere inaañ e-ekenọọhọ adudu ebo editʌkkọ isọñ ye mme akpainyañ: <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />“Ikiitʌkkọ isọñ ye akpainyañ ye mme eto tutu ñnyịn inịm idiọọñọ ke akpọiso mme isʌñutom Abasi ñnyịn.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Ndin ami mmaakop ibad mbon emaekenịm idiọọñọ, ekedo 144,000 e-eketooho afịd ubon nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="REV 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Se ikito ufọk Yuda e-ekenịmme idiọọñọ ekedo 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:5">ake ufọk Rubịn 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:5">ufọk Kaad 12,000,<verse eid="REV 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />ufọk Asa 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:6">ufọk Naftali 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:6">ufọk Manase 12,000,<verse eid="REV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />ufọk Simiọn 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:7">ufọk Lifai 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:7">ufọk Isakka 12,000,<verse eid="REV 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />ufọk Sebulọn 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:8">ufọk Yosef 12,000, ye</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:8">ufọk Benyamin 12,000.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekamba Atu Awo E-esiineke Mfia Afọñidem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />“Ke mme ñkpọ ami emaekeboiyo mmaakịt ke iso mmi ekamba atu awo a-awo ndomokeed imiikpikanna ibat naña eba, afịd mme idịd, aduuk, usem ye afịd ubon awo naña eda ke iso ebekpo ye ke iso Ayịn Edọñ. Ammọ ekesiine mfia afọñidem enyʌñ ekaama mme ndak ayob ke ubọk. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Ndin ammọ emaebọñ ke akpọsọñ uyio ete:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">“Adinyaaña anie Abasi ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">a-atieghe ke ebekpo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">anyʌñ anie Ayịn Edọñ.<verse eid="REV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Afịd mme enyere emaeda ekanna ebekpo ekʌk, ye mme ñkpisọñ ye mme aduuwem ñkpọ, enyʌñ eduọññọ ekʌp iso ke isọñ ke iso ebekpo ekpono Abasi, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />ebo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">“Amen!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Itooro ye ubọọñ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">ye aniọñ ye ekọọm ye ukpono</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">ye adudu ye ukeme</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">enie Abasi ñnyịn ke nsi-nsi nsi-nsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Amen!”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Ndin keed ke atu mme ñkpisọñ amaambịp miin ate, “Mbon e-esiineke mfia afọñidem ami, ammọ edoñño mme anie, ammọ eto uke edi?”<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Ami mmaabọọrọ nte, “Ete! Afo amediọọñọ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Ndin anye amaabo: “Mbon ami edoñño mbon e-ewuọñọke ke ekamba ukuud edi, ammọ emaeyet afọñidem ammọ enyʌñ enam nọ afia ke iyiib Ayịn Edọñ. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Ado anam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">“ammọ eba ke iso ebekpo Abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">enyʌñ enam utom adikpono anye ke uweemeayio ye akonayio ke tembịd amọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">ndin anye a-atieghe ke ebekpo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">ayaatat mba amọ afʌk ammọ.<verse eid="REV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />‘Abiọọñ idiidọñnọ ammọ aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">itọñ idiinyʌññọ isat ammọ aba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:16">Ayio idiimiaha ammọ,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">akpọsọñ ufiob idiinyʌññọ ituuk ammọ.<verse eid="REV 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Sia Ayịn Edọñ a-abaaha ke ufọọd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">ebekpo ayaado akpemeedọñ anọ ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:17">‘ayaaben ammọ akaa idịm mmọọñ uwem.’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">‘Ndin Abasi ayaakwokko afịd mmọọñayịd afep ke anyen ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ayọhọ Ufiikñkpọ Itiaba ye Usan Usịn Insensi a-Kold</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Ke anye amaakekʌppọ ayọhọ ufiikñkpọ itiaba, ndobo amaaba ke hefịn ke ñkpọ nte ubaak awa keed.<verse eid="REV 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Ndin ami mmaakịt mme enyere itiaba naña eda ke iso Abasi, ndin emaenọ ammọ adukpoñ itiaba.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Enyere mfen a-akekamake ñkpọ ufọb insensi e-enamma ke kold, amaadida ke itie uwa. Emaenọ anye uwak insensi adifọp, ye mme akam mme ndisana ikọd Abasi ke itie ufọb uwa kold, ke iso ebekpo. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Nsʌñikañ insensi ado, ye akam mme ndisana awo emaeto ubọk enyere ado edọọk ekaa iso Abasi. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Ndin enyere ado amaaben ñkpọ ufọb insensi adọñ ikañ a-aketooho itie ufọbuwa, atop asuan ke isọñ. Ndin emaekop uyom ye ndukuunọ aduma, enyʌñ ekịt unwana ikañ akebkeb ye unyeñisọñ.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Adukpoñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Ndin mme enyere itiaba e-ekekamake mme adukpoñ itiaba emaebeeñe idem adifịt ammọ.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Akpa enyere amaafịt adukpoñ amọ ndin edịm itiad a-akesañake ye ikañ ye iyiib amaadep aduọkkọ ke ederimbod. Ubaak ederimbod keed ke itie ita amaata ikañ akweeñe, ubaak keed ke itie ita ye mme eto emaenyʌñ eta ikañ ekweeñe, afịd mme awawa mbid emaenyʌñ esak ekweeñe.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Ayọhọ enyere iba amaafịt adukpoñ amọ, ndin emaetop ñkpọ a-akebaaha nte ataa ekamba abod a-akesakka ikañ esịn ke inyañ. Ubaak inyañ keed ke itie ita amaakappa ado iyiib. <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />Ubaak keed ke itie ita ke atu afịd ñkpọ se ikidu uwem ke esịd akpainyañ emaekpañña, ndin emaebiat ubaak keed ke itie ita nsʌñikañ ke akpainyañ.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Ayọhọ enyere ita amaafịt adukpoñ amọ, ndin ataa ekamba ntantaafiọñ, a-akeyammake nte ikañ emuum amaato ikpaanyọñ adiduọ ke akpammọọñ ayọhọ ubaak ita ye ke mme mmọọñ idịm. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Anyịñ ntantaafiọñ ado akedo Wọọmwuud<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wọọmwuud ado ataa idod-idod ñkpọ nte atidod.</char></note>. Ayọhọ ubaak mmọọñ keed ke itie ita amaakappa adodoro ndin uwak awo se ikinwọñ emaekpañña eto idod mmọọñ ado.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Ayọhọ enyere inaañ amaafịt adukpoñ amọ, ndin emaetuak ayọhọ ubaak keed ke itie ita utịn, ayọhọ ubaak keed ke itie ita afiọñ ye ayọhọ ubaak keed ke itie ita ntantaafiọñ tutu ayọhọ ita ammọ afịd akappa abubịd. Ayọhọ ubaak ita usen ado ikinieghe unwana. Ayọhọ ubaak keed ke itie ita akonayio ñko ikinieghe unwana.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Ami ñkesʌk nse, ndikop naña ntrukpuum keed a-akesʌkkọ afuuro ke ufọọd anyọñ abọñ ke akpọsọñ uyio abo: “Nsobo! Nsobo! Nsobo anọ mme andidʌñ ke isọñ adiito uyio adukpoñ a-mme enyere ita e-esʌhọke ediifịt!”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ayọhọ Adukpoñ Ition</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Enyere ayọhọ ition amaafịt adukpoñ amọ, ndin ami mmaakịt ntantaafiọñ a-amaaketo ikpaanyọñ adiduọ ke isọñ. Emaenọ ntantaafiọñ ado ukpọhọde Abis. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Ke anye amaakekpọkkọ usʌñ Abis, nsʌñikañ a-aketooho awuọ akebit nsʌñikañ ekamba ñkpọdiọhọ ikañ. Utịn ye ikpaanyọñ ekenweenwen ke ntak nsʌñikañ a-aketooho Abis ado awuọ. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Mme ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ emaeto nsʌñikañ ado ewuọñọ edọñọ ederimbod, ndin emaenọ ammọ adudu nte mme ikpeyen ederimbod. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Emaedọkkọ ammọ ebo ekuubiat mme mbid ke ederimbod me eto se ikọkọt ndomokeed, ibọhọke afịd mbon i-imiinieghe idiọọñọ ufiikñkpọ Abasi ke akpọiso ammọ. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Awo ikinọọhọ ammọ adudu adiwowot ammọ, akedo aditọtʌhọde ammọ ke afiọñ ition. Ndin ubiak se ammọ ekebọọ aketie nte ikpeyen atop awo. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Ke ini ado mme awo eyaeyem ñkpa, ado idiikịtte; ñkpa ayaawʌt ammọ, ado ñkpa ayaafeghe akpọñ ammọ.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Mme ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ ado ekebit mme enañmbakara e-emaekebeeñe idem adika ekọñ. Ammọ ekeyara ñkpọ nte ntinya kold ke iwuod ammọ, ndin iso ammọ ekebit iso awo. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Ided ammọ akeba nte ided ibaan, ndin eded ammọ ekebit eded ekpe. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Ammọ emaenie ufʌk ikpanesịd a-akebitte ukwak, ndin uyom a-mba ammọ ekenamma akeyomo nte ñkpad uwak enañmbakara ye mme sariọd e-efeeñeke eka ekọñ. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Ammọ emaenieñe nsịm asịneke ata nte mme ikpeyen, ndin nsịm ammọ emaenie adudu aditʌhọde mme awo ke afiọñ ition. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Adidem ammọ akedo enyere Abis, a-anyịñ amọ ke usem Hibru adooho Abadọn, ndin ke usem Krik ekoot Abọliọn (a-awuọñọke Andisobo).<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Akpa ukuud a-aboiyo, ukuud iba mfen idisịmme diin.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayọhọ Adukpoñ Itiokeed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Ayọhọ enyere itiokeed amaafịt adukpoñ amọ, ndin mmaakop naña uyio awuọ ato mme nnʌk akpokoro uwa kold a-abaaha ke iso Abasi adi. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Anye amaabo ayọhọ enyere itiokeed a-akekamake adukpoñ ate, “Tat mme enyere inaañ e-ekebọppọ ke ekamba inyañ Yufretis.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Ndin emaetat mme enyere inaañ e-ekenịmme ke mbeeñeidem enọ awa ami, ye usen, ye afiọñ, ye isua ami eyaak ebo ewoot ayọhọ ubaak keed ke itie ita ke ubon awo. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Ibad mbon ekọñ se ikidoro ke enañmbakara ye ukpadñkpọ ekedo tọsịn ikie duob akañ iba ke itie tọsịn doub. Ami mmaakop ibad ammọ.<verse eid="REV 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Mme enañmbakara ye mme andiwaad ammọ a-ami ñkekịtte ke ñkukịd mmi ekebañña ntom: Mme mfʌhọ ikpanesịd ammọ akeba ikañ-ikañ, ndad-ndad, ekịm-ekịm bru, mme uto-uto nte sọlfọ. Mme iwuod mme enañmbakara ado ekebit mme iwuod ekpe, ndin ikañ, nsʌñikañ ye sọlfọ emaewuọñọ eto inua ammọ. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Emaewot mbakka keed ke itie ita ke se ito uduud awo ato ke unọmọ ita ami a-adooho ikañ, nsʌñikañ ye sọlfọ a-akewuọñọke ato inua ammọ. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Adudu mme enañmbakara ami akesịne ke inua ye nsịm ammọ; sia mme nsịm ammọ ekebañña nte udʌkikọd, e-enieñeke iwuod a-ammọ ekamake enọ mme awo unan.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Mme awo se ikisʌhọ a-mme unọmọ ami imiikiwotto ikisʌkkọ ikakappa esịd ibaña mme ubọkutom ammọ. Ammọ ikitreke adikpono mme dimọn, ye mme ubobodñkpọ kold, silfa, brọns, itiad ye eto, mme ubobodñkpọ i-imiikanna ikịt usʌñ, ikoppo ikọ, inyʌññọ isaña isañ. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Ammọ ikikappake esịd ibaña uwodawo, ubre idiọọñ, usịn efịbe ye use, me uyịb inọ ammọ.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s1">Enyere ye Etək Ikpañwed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Ndin ami mmaakịt ekamba enyere mfen naña asọiyọ ato hefịn adi. Anye akesịne ntọñanyọñ nte afọñidem, ye adʌkabasi naña aba ke anyọñ iwuod amọ. Iso amọ akebit utịn, ndin mme ukod amọ ekebit mme adaaha ikañ. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Anye amaakama etək ikpañwed a-akekʌppọke ana ke ubọk amọ. Anye amaawuuk ukod nnasia amọ ke inyañ, ye ukod ufiin ke abod. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Anye amaabọọñ ñkpo nte ekpe akuun, ndin mme uyio aduma itiaba emaetañ ikọ. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Ndin ke ini mme aduma itiaba ado emaeketañ ikọ, ami mmaayem adiwet se ammọ eketañ, ado mmaakop naña uyio ato ke hefịn abo, “Sọọñọ mme ikọ se mme aduma itiaba ado etañ ke ufiikñkpọ, ado kuuwewet anye unịm.”<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Ndin enyere a-ami ñkekịtte naña ada ke inyañ ye ke abod amaadịppe ubọk nnasia amọ ke hefịn. <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />Ndin anye amaanwọñọ ke anyịñ andidu uwem ke nsi-nsi nsi-nsi, andikibot mme hefịn ye afịd se idọñọ ke esịd, isọñ ye afịd se idọñọ ke esịd, akpainyañ ye afịd se idọñọ ke esịd, anyʌñ abo, “Ubiadini idiibaaha aba. <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Ado ke mme usen a-ayọhọ enyere itiaba adiifịt adukpoñ amọ, eyaenam mme ndedịbe ñkpọ Abasi ema, kpa naña anye amaaketatañ anọ mme isʌñutom ye mme prọfed amọ.”<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Ndin uyio a-ami mmaakekop nto hefịn amaamaana atañ ikọ ini keed mfen ye ami ate, “Kaa, keben ikpañwed a-akʌppọke ana ke ubọk enyere a-adaaha ke akpainyañ ye ke unaisọñ.”<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Ndin ami mmaakaa ñkebo enyere ado yak anye annọ etək ikpañwed ado. Ndin anye amambo miin, “Bọ mi nyʌñ ta. Ayaanam idịb mfo akpakpaiya, ‘ado ayaunem nte adanakwọọk ke inua.’ ” <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Ami mmaabọ etək ikpañwed ado ke ubọk enyere ado nta. Anye amaanem nte adanakwọọk ke inua mmi, ado ke ini ami mmaaketa anye mma, idịb mmi amaakappa akpakpaiya. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Ndin emaembo ete, “Ana afo amaana atañ prọfesi abaña uwak uduud awo, mme idịd, mme usem ye mme ndidem.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ntiense Iba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Emaennọ akọọk a-akebaaha nte esañ udomoñkpọ enyʌñ embo, “Kaa ke domo tembịd Abasi ye itie uwa nyʌñ bat ibad mme andikpono Abasi. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Ado kuudomo akwere anwa esiin tembịd. Sio anye ado fep, sia e-eyaak udo enọ mme Gentile. Ammọ eyaedat ukod esọnnọ adisana abio ke afiọñ aba mme iba. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Ndin Ami ñyaanọ mme ntiense mmi iba adudu, ammọ eyaetañ prọfesi ke mme usen tọsịn keed, ikie iba mme ata (1,260), ediinyʌñ isiine afọñ ikpo.” <verse eid="REV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Ammọ edoñño mme “eto ọlif iba” ye mme ñkpọ udod utuenikañ iba e-edaaha ke iso Abọọñ ederimbod. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Awo akeedodo a-anwanake adinam ammọ idiọọk ñkpọ, ikañ ayaato inua ammọ awuọ ata mme asua ammọ awot. Ntoro ke awo akeedodo a-anwanake adinam ammọ idiọọk ñkpọ adiikpa. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Mbon ami e-enie adudu adikọp mme hefịn mbaak edịm adidep ke mme ini a-ammọ etañña brọfesi. Ammọ enyʌñ enie adudu adinam mme mmọọñ ekappa edo iyiib enyʌñ ekeme adimia ederimbod ufen ye se utọ unọmọ a-ammọ emaahama ye ke ini se ammọ emama.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Ammọ emaetañ ikọ ntiense ammọ ema, idiọọk unam ayaawuọ ato Abis adinwana ye ammọ, akan ammọ anyʌñ awoot ammọ. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Mme akpo ammọ ediibono ke ufed ekamba abio ado, a-adooho ke ñkanna ikọ ekoot Sọdọm ye Iyib, itie ekenyʌññọ ekọñ Abọọñ ammọ ke eto. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Ke usen ita ye ubaak, afịd ubon awo, aduuk, usem ye idịd eyaesese akpo ammọ enyʌñ esịn edibuuk ammọ. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Mme andidʌñọ ederimbod eyaenọ ammọ ñnyọ, enyʌñ enañña usọrọ idem ammọ ke edinọññọ emọ-emọ mme enọ, sia mme prọfed iba ami emaenọ mme andidʌñ ke ederimbod akpọsọñ ufen.<verse eid="REV 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Ado ke usen ita mme ubaak emaekeboiyo, inweek uwem amaato Abasi adidʌk ammọ idem, ndin ammọ emaedakka eda ke ukod ammọ, ndin ataa ndịk amaamʌm afịd mbon e-ekekịtte ammọ. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Ndin ammọ emaekop naña ekamba uyio ato hefịn abo ammọ ate, “Idọọk idi mmi.” Ndin ammọ emaedọọk esaña ke ntọñanyọñ edʌk hefịn, ke ini mme asua ammọ ekesʌkkọ esese.<verse eid="REV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Kpa ke awa ado akpọsọñ unyeñisọñ amaatịppe, ndin keed ke mbaak duob abio ado amaaduọ. Awo tọsịn itiaba emaekpañña ke unyeñisọñ ado, ndin mme andikisʌhọ ke uwem emaekop ataa ndịk enyʌñ enọ Abasi andiba ke hefịn ubọọñ.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Ayọhọ ukuud iba a-aboiyo, ayọhọ ukuud ita asʌk adi usọp-usọp.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayọhọ Adukpoñ Itiaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Ayọhọ enyere itiaba amaafịt adukpoñ amọ, ndin ekamba uyio amaawuọ ato hefịn a-akebooho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">“Abioubọọñ ederimbod a-akappa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">abioubọọñ Abọọñ ñnyịn ye ake Krais amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">ndin anye ayaakara ke nsi-nsi, nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="REV 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Ndin mme ñkpisọñ edịb mme inaañ e-eketieghe ke mme ebekpo ubọọñ ammọ ke iso Abasi emaeduọññọ ekuup iso ammọ ke isọñ enyʌñ ekpono Abasi, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />ete:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">“Ñnyịn imunọ fiin ekọọm, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Andikponñkan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">Anye a-abaaha, a-akenyʌññọ ababa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">sia Afo amedat ekamba adudu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">mfo amenyʌñ atọọñọ adikara.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Mme idịd emaeyaat esịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ndin ifiobesịd mfo adi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Ini adikem adikpe ikpe mme akpañkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ye adinọ mme isʌñutom mfo mme prọfed ñkpọ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">ye nti nditọ mfo e-enọọhọ anyịñ mfo ukpono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ñkpoon ye ntək,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">ye adiwoot mbon e-ebiada ederimbod.”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Ndin emaebeere tembịd Abasi ke hefịn, ndin ke esịd tembịd ado emaekịt akebe edioomo Abasi. Ndin unwana akebkeb amaasakka, emaenyʌñ ekop ndukuunọ ye akpọsọñ uyom aduma, ye unyeñisọñ ye ekamba edịm itiad.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Awonwaan ye Drakọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Ekamba utịppe idiọọñọ amaawuọ ada ke hefịn. Mmaakịt awonwaan a-akesịneke utịn nte afọñidem ke idem, afiọñ ke idak ñkpad amọ, anyʌñ ayara ntinya ntantaafiọñ duob mme iba ke iwuod amọ. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Anye akesaña ye idịb, ndin ke ini akeyemme adiman ayịn anye amaasio ñkpo ke ntak ubiak uman. <verse eid="REV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Ndin idiọọñọ mfen amaawuọ ada ke hefịn. Mmaakịt ataa ekamba ndad-ndad drakọn a-akenieghe iwuod itiaba ye nnʌk duob ye ntinya itiaba ke mme iwuod amọ. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Isịm amọ amaakwọk keed ke ubaak ita ntantaafiọñ e-ekewuọñọke ke ikpaanyọñ aduọọk ke isọñ. Drakọn ado amaada ke iso awonwaan a-akeyemme adiman ayịn, nọ ayịn ado amaasʌk amamana anye aben amen. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Anye amaaman ayịn a-adiikara afịd idịd ke esañ ukwak, ndin emaewappa anye ayịn ado ebọ, eben esọk Abasi ke ebekpo amọ. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Awonwaan ado amaafeghe anyọñ anaan, itie A-Abasi akediọññọ anịm anọ anye, nọ ediise anye anyen ke mme usen tọsịn keed mme ikie iba mme ata (1,260).<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Ndin ekọñ amaasakka ke hefịn. Maikel ye mme enyere amọ emaenwana ye drakọn ado, ndin drakọn ado ye mme enyere amọ emaenyʌñ enwana ye ammọ. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Ado drakọn ikisọññọ adudu ikem, ndin anye amaaduọọk itie ammọ ke hefịn. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Emaetop ekamba drakọn ado eduọọk ke isọñ, akaan udʌkikọd e-ekoodo andidiọọk me Setan, anye a-anamma afịd ederimbod ewuọ ekpọñ usʌñ. Emaetop anye eduọọk ke isọñ ye mme enyere amọ.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Ndin ami mmaakop naña ekamba uyio ke hefịn abo ate:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">“Idahami adinyaaña ye adudu e-edi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">ye abioubọọñ Abasi ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">ye ukara Krais amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">Sia esio anye a-asidotto nditọeka ñnyịn ke Krais uyio eduọọk ke isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">anye a-asidotto ammọ uyio ke iso Abasi ñnyịn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">ke uweemeayio ye akonayio.<verse eid="REV 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Ammọ emaekan anye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">ke iyiib Ayịn Edọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">ye ke ikọ ntiense ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">ammọ ikimaaha uwem ammọ ikisịm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">itie adisịkke idem nsio ke ñkpa.<verse eid="REV 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Ke ntoro, mme hefịn idaara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">ye ndufo mbon e-edʌññọ ke esịd!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Ado adọdiọọk anọ isọñ ye akpainyañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">sia andidiọọk asọiyọ ibịne ndufo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Anye ayọhọ ye ifiobesịd, sia a-adiọọñọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">ke ini imọ asʌhọ etək-etək.”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Ndin ke drakọn amaakekịt ke i-itop imọ eduọọk ke isọñ, anye amaafeghe abịne awonwaan a-akemanna ayịn ado. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Emaenọ awonwaan ado mba ekamba ntrukpuum iba nọ anye akan afuuro aka itie e-ekediọññọ enịm enọ anye ke anaan, itie e-ediise anye anyen ke isua ita ye ubaak, mbaak idiọọk udʌkikọd ado adisịme anye. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Ndin udʌkikọd ado amaatop mmọọñ asio ke inua amọ nte inyañ, ayem adikpuut awonwaan ado mben ke udiọọñ mmọọñ ado. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Ado isọñ amaanwam awonwaan ado ke aditat inua amọ mmen mmọọñ inyañ a-drakọn ado akekọkkọ ke inua amọ. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Ndin drakọn amaanekke ayat esịd ye awonwaan ado, anyʌñ adọñ idem akaa adikinwana ekọñ ye afịd mfịd idịb amọ se ikisʌhọ, mbon e-enịmme mme mbed Abasi, enyʌñ emʌm ikọ ntiense Yisọs ekama.<verse eid="REV 12:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s1">Idiọọk Unam A-awuọhọ ke Akpainyañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Ndin drakọn ado amaada ke mben akpainyañ. Ndin ami mmaakịt naña idiọọk unam awuọ ke akpainyañ. Anye akenie nnʌk duob ye iwuod itiaba, anyanya duob enyʌñ edudot ke mme nnʌk amọ, ndin ke iwuod keedekeed emaewet anyịñ a-akenọọhọ Abasi usọñanyen. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Idiọọk unam a-ami ñkekịtte akebit ekpeikọd, ado anye akenie ñkpad nte anawịdekpe, inua amọ anyʌñ abit inua ekpe. Drakọn amaayaak adudu amọ ye ebekpo amọ ye ekamba adudu amọ anọ idiọọk unam ado. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Keed ke atu mme iwuod idiọọk unam ado akeba nte akenie ataa ekamba unan a-akpekedooho se iwot anye, ado emaekọk unan ado. Idem amaakpa afịd ederimbod ndin ammọ emaenyʌñ ekeene idiọọk unam ado. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Mme awo emaekpono drakọn ado, sia anye amaayaak ukara amọ anọ idiọọk unam ado. Ammọ emaenyʌñ ekpono idiọọk unam ado enyʌñ ebịp ete, “Anie awo itie nte idiọọk unam! Anie awo ikeme adinwana ekọñ ye anye?”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Emaenọ idiọọk unam ado inua aditañ mme ikọ asian-asian, ye mme ikọ isuuñọ ye adida ukara, ke afiọñ aba ye iba. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Anye amaakʌppọ inua amọ adisuuk Abasi uyio, anyʌñ asueñ anyịñ amọ ye itie idʌñ amọ ye mme andidʌñ ke hefịn. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Emaenọ anye adudu adinwana ekọñ ye mme ikọd Abasi ñnyʌñ ñkan ammọ. Emaenyʌñ enọ anye adudu adikara afịd ubon awo, aduuk, usem ye idịd. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Afịd mme andidʌñ ederimbod eyaekpono idiọọk unam ado, afịd awo se anyịñ ammọ imiiwereke ke ñwed uwem a-anieghe Ayịn Edọñ, e-ekewotto tọọñọ ke ini ekebotto ederimbod.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Awo akeedodo a-anieghe utọñ yak anye akop.<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Awo akeedodo a-anaaha adʌk afʌn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">kpa afʌn ke anye adiidʌk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">Awo akeedodo a-anaaha ewot ke akañkañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">kpa ke akañkañ ke ediiwot anye.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 13:10">Ñkpọ ami ayem ataa ime ye nsọọñọnda ke mbuọdidem ato nditọ Abasi.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Idiọọk Unam A-awuọhọ ke Isọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Ndin ami mmaakịt idiọọk unam mfen naña awuọ ato isọñ. Anye akenie nnʌk iba nte edọñ, ado atañ ikọ nte drakọn. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Anye akekama ukara anọ akpa idiọọk unam anyʌn anam ederimbod ye mme andidʌñ ke esịd ekpono akpa idiọọk unam e-ekekọkkọ ekamba unan ke iwuod amọ. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Ndin anye amaanañña mme ikpọ utịppe idiọọñọ, tutu asịm adinam ikañ asọiyọ ato hefịn adi isọñ ke iso afịd awo. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Ato ke ntak mme idiọọñọ e-ekenọọhọ anye adudu adinam ke iwuod akpa idiọọk unam, anye amaabiaña mme andidʌñ ke ederimbod. Anye amaawuuk ammọ ate enam ubobodñkpọ ke mbid ye ke ukpono akpa idiọọk unam emaekenọ unan ke akañkañ, akpesʌkado a-anye asʌkkọ adodu uwem. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Emaenyʌñ enọ anye adudu adinọ mbid akpa idiọọk unam inweek uwem nọ anye akan atañ ikọ anyʌñ anam ewoot afịd mbon se imiikinyịmmeke adikpono mbid akpa idiọọk unam ado. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Anye amaanyʌñ anyịk afịd awo, ntək ye ikpo, mme anie ñkpọ ye mme uweene, mme amanaisọñ ye mme afʌn, adibọ idiọọñọ ke ubọk nnasia me ke akpọiso, <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />mbaak awo ndomokeed adikan adep me anyam ñkpọ ibọhọke anye anie idiọọñọ a-adooho anyịñ idiọọk unam me ibad anyịñ amọ.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Ñkpọ ami ayem aniọñ. Yak awo a-anieghe ikike abat nọmba idiọọk unam ado, sia ado nọmba awo. Nọmba amọ ado ikie itiokeed mme ata mme itiokeed (666).<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ayịn Edọñ ye Awo 144,000</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Ndin ami mmaase ñnyʌñ ñkịt Ayịn Edọñ ado naña ada ke iso mmi ke Abod Saiyọn ye mme awo 144,000 e-emaekewet anyịñ Ayịn Edọñ ye anyịñ Ete amọ ke akpọiso ammọ. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Ndin mmaakop uyom naña ato hefịn a-akeyomoke nte mbufuud mmọọñ ye nte aduma a-asakka ke akpọsọñ uyio. Uyom a-ami ñkekoppo akeba nte ikwọ ndido a-mme andibre ndido ebreke. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Ndin ammọ emaekwọ ufa ikwọ ke iso ebekpo ye ke iso mme aduuwem unam inaañ ye mme ñkpisọñ ado. Awo ndomokeed ikikanna ikpeep ufa ikwọ ado ibọhọke mme awo tọsịn ikie keed mme aba mme inaañ (144,000) ado e-emaekefak esio ke ederimbod. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Mbon ami edo mbon i-imiikisappake idem ammọ ye ibaan, sia emaenịm idem ammọ asana. Ammọ emaekeene Ayịn Edọñ itie akeedodo a-anye akekaaha. Emaedep ammọ esio ke atu ubon awo enyʌñ eyaak ammọ enọ Abasi ye Ayịn Edọñ nte mme akpa mfịd. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Nsu ndomokeed ikibaaha ammọ ke inua; ammọ inieghe ndo.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enyere Ita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Ndin mmaakịt enyere mfen naña afuuro ke ufọọd afịm, ndin anye amaanie nsi-nsi eti etob adikwọrọ nnọọ mme andidʌñ ke ederimbod, afịd mme idịd, aduuk, usem ye afịd ubon awo. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Anye amaabọọñ ke akpọsọñ uyio ate, “Baak Abasi nyʌñ nọ anye ubọọñ, sia awa ubiideikpe amọ adikem. Kpono anye a-akenamma mme hefịn, ederimbod, akpa inyañ, ye mme idịm mmọọñ.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Ayọhọ enyere iba amaakeene anye abo, “ ‘a-aduọ! Ekamba Babilọn a-aduọ,’ anye a-akenamma afịd mme idịd enwọñ ukọd edamma ke mme efịbe amọ.”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Ayọhọ enyere ita amaakeene ammọ atañ ke akpọsọñ uyio ate, “Adieke awo ndomokeed akponoke idiọọk unam ye mbid idem amọ, anyʌñ abọ idiọọñọ ke akpọiso me ke ubọk amọ, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />ammọ ñko eyaenwọñ ifiobesịd Abasi nte ukọd e-emaeketọkkọ edọñ nọ ayọhọ kọọb iyadesịd amọ. Eyaedutʌkkọ ammọ ke ikañ sọlfọ ke iso mme ndisana enyere ye Ayịn Edọñ. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Ndin nsʌñikañ ndutʌhọ ammọ ayaakaa iso adọọk anyọñ ke nsi-nsi nsi-nsi. Nduọkadudu idiibaaha uweemeayio me akonayio inọ mbon e-ekponoke idiọọk unam ado ye mbid amọ, ye awo akeedodo a-abọọhọ idiọọñọ anyịñ amọ.” <verse eid="REV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Ñkpọ ami ayem ime ye ndopuyio ato mme ndisana ikọd Abasi e-enịmme mbed Abasi enyʌñ esọọñọ eda ke Yisọs.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Ndin mmaakop uyio naña ato hefịn abo: “Wet ate, tọọñọ ke ami, afọfọn anọ mme akpañkpa e-ekpaaha ke Abọọñ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">Ndin Sịbidịd abo, “Ii, ammọ eyaeduọk adudu ke utom ammọ, sia mme adinam ammọ ayaakeene ammọ.”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Idọk Ederimbod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Ami mmaase, ñnyʌñ ñkịt ke iso mmi afia ntọñanyọñ, ndin andikitie ke ntọñanyọñ ami akeba nte ayịn awo, ayara ntinya kold ke iwuod amọ anyʌñ akama usọb ikwa ke ubọk amọ. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Ndin enyere mfen amaawuọ ke tembịd adikoot andikitie ke ntọñanyọñ ke akpọsọñ uyio, ate: “Ben ikwa idọk mfo tọọñọ adikpeeñe ukpeeñe, sia ini idọk a-akem; ini ukpeeñe ederimbod a-akem.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Ndin andikitie ke ntọñanyọñ amaakanna usọb ikwa ukpeeñe amọ akpeeñe, ndin emaedọk idọk ederimbod.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Enyere mfen amaawuọ ke tembịd Abasi ke hefịn adi, anye ñko amaakama ikwa ukpeeñe a-asọppọ. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Ñko enyere mfen a-akeseeghe ñkpọ abaña ikañ, amaato itie uwa adi anyʌñ akoot andikikama usọb ikwa ukpeeñe ke akpọsọñ uyio abo: “Ben ikwa ukpeeñe mfo a-asọppọ nyʌñ kpeeñe mme ayọ kreb sịññe ke fain ederimbod, sia mme kreb amọ e-edat.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Enyere ado amaatop ikwa amọ a-asọppọ akanna anyʌñ akpeeñe mme kreb ederimbod atop adọñ ke ekamba udʌñ unuak ukọd ifiobesịd Abasi. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Emaesọnnọ ammọ ke udʌñ unyịmmeukọd ke edem abio, ndin iyiib amaafiọrọ ato udʌñ unyịmmeukọd, awak tutu adọọk akeda ke idaha ñkpaha inua enañmbakara anyʌñ, anyọọñ ke stadia tọsịn keed mme ikie itiokeed (1,600) a-adooho itiad ikie ita (300).<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Enyere Itiaba ye Unọmọ Itiaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Mmaakịt ke hefịn ekamba utịppe idiọọñọ mfen. Enyere itiaba ye mme akpatre unọmọ itiaba, akpatre sia ke ammọ iyadesịd Abasi a-akem. <verse eid="REV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Ndin mmaakịt se ikitie nte akpainyañ a-kraasi a-akesakka ikañ. Mbon e-ekedaaha ediana akpainyañ ado ekedo mbon e-emaekekan idiọọk unam ye mbid amọ ye ibad anyịñ amọ. Ammọ emaekama ndido A-Abasi akenọọhọ ammọ, <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />enyʌñ ekwọ ikwọ Moses, isʌñutom Abasi, ye ikwọ Ayịn Edọñ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">“Mme adinam mfo edoñño ñkpoon ye utịppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Andikponñkan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Mme usʌñ mfo e-enen enyʌñ edoñño akpanikọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Adidem mme idịd.<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Mme anie imiiduubaaha fiin, O, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">inyʌñ inọ anyịñ mfo ubọọñ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Sia Afo ikpọọñ ado adisana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Afịd mme idịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">eyaedukpono fiin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">sia eyaara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mme ikọ ikwọ ami ato ikpañwed Saam 111:2, 3; Ditrọnọmi 32:4; Yerimaiya 10:7; Saam 86:9; Saam 98:2.</char></note> mme ndinen utom mfo.”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Ke ami amaakeboiyo, mmaakịt tembịd ke hefịn naña akʌkkọ, a-adooho atayad edioomo mbed. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Mme enyere itiaba e-ekekamake mme unọmọ itiaba emaewuọñọ edi. Ammọ ekesịne nsasana, ñyayamma linen enyʌñ ebọbọ mme ñkpaha kold ekanna ikpanesịd ammọ. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Ndin keed ke atu mme aduuwem unam inaañ ado amaanọ mme enyere itiaba mme bọwịd kold itiaba e-emaekeyọhọ ye ifiobesịd Abasi, a-aduuho uwem ke nsi-nsi nsi-nsi. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Ndin tembịd amaayọhọ ye nsʌñikañ a-atooho ubọọñ Abasi ye adudu amọ, ndin awo ndomokeed ikikanna idʌk tembịd tutu mme unọmọ itiaba a-mme enyere itiaba ado ekekamake akweeñe.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Bọwịd Ifiobesịd Abasi Itiaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Ndin ami mmaakop ekamba uyio naña ato tembịd abo mme enyere itiaba ado ate: “Ikaa ikitoomo mme bọwịd ifiobesịd Abasi itiaba ado idọñ ke ederimbod.”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Akpa enyere amaakaa aketop bọwịd ifiobesịd amọ aduọk ke isọñ, ndin ndiọi inia a-akesañake ye akpọsọñ ubiak emaebomo ewuọñọ ke idem mbon e-emaekebọ idiọọñọ idiọọk unam enyʌñ ekpono ubobod mbid idem amọ.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Ayọhọ enyere iba amaatop bọwịd ifiobesịd amọ aduọk ke akpainyañ, ndin anye amaakappa iyiib, atie nte iyiib awo ñkpa, ndin afịd mme aduuwem ñkpọ ke akpainyañ emaekpañña.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Ayọhọ enyere ita amaatop bọwịd ifiobesịd amọ aduọk ke mme inyañ, mme idịm mmọọñ, ndin ammọ emaekappa iyiib. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Ndin ami mmaakop naña enyere andise ñkpọ mbaña mmọọñ abo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">“Afo Andido Adisana, amenen ke mme ubiideikpe ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">Afo a-abaaha, a-akenyʌññọ ababa,<verse eid="REV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />sia ammọ e-eduọk iyiib mme ndisana awo mfo ye ake mme prọfed mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">ndin afo amenọ ammọ iyiib enwọñ, kpa naña adot ye ammọ.”<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Ndin ami mmaakop naña akpokoro uwa abọọrọ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">“Ii, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Andikponñkan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">mme ubiideikpe mfo edoñño akpanikọ ye unen.”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Ayọhọ enyere inaañ amaaduọk usan amọ ke utịn, ndin emaenọ utịn unen adifọp mme awo ke ikañ. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Idem ammọ amaayaaña ato akpọsọñ ufiob, ndin ammọ emaesueñ anyịñ Abasi, Andikikara mme unọmọ ado, ado ammọ emaesịn edikappa esịd ñnyʌñ nnọọ anye ubọọñ.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Ayọhọ enyere ition amaaduọk bọwịd amọ ke ebekpo idiọọk unam ado, ndin ekịm amaafʌk abioubọọñ amọ. Mme awo emaedoom edeme ammọ ke ntak akpọsọñ ubiak, <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />enyʌñ esueñ Abasi ke hefịn ke ntak akpọsọñ ubiak ye inia a-aketaaha ammọ, ado ammọ emaesịn adikappa esịd ñkpọñ se ammọ ekenam.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Ayọhọ enyere itiokeed amaaduọk bọwịd amọ ke ekamba inyañ Yufretis, ndin mmọọñ amọ amaasat nọ abeeñe usʌñ anịm anọ mme ndidem e-etooho Usakkautịn. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Ndin ami mmaakịt mme ndedeghe sịbidịd ita e-ekebitte mme mfuọd; ammọ ekewuọñọ ke inua drakọn, ewuọñọ eto inua idiọọk unam ye inua prọfed abiaña. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Ammọ edoñño mme sịbidịd dimọn e-enaññake mme idiọọñọ, ndin ammọ ewuọñọ ebịne mme ndidem afịd ederimbod adikoono ammọ nọ edinwana ekọñ ke ekamba usen Abasi Andikponñkan.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />
    <char style="wj">“Sese, ami ndi nte inọ! Afọfọn anọ awo a-atabake idab anyʌñ asịne afọñ amọ ke idem, mbaak anye adisaña ifed anyʌñ adia ndọk.”</char><verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Ndin ammọ emaekoono mme ndidem ederimbod ekaa itie e-ekootto Amakedọn ke usem Hibru.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Enyere ayọhọ itiaba amaatop bọwịd amọ aduọk ke afịm, ndin ekamba uyio amaato tembịd awuọ ke ebekpo abo “E-enam ema!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Ndin mme unwana akebkeb emaesaiya, ndukuunọ ye akpọsọñ uyom aduma ye ekamba unyeñisọñ amaaba. Utọ unyeñisọñ ado kpaanaanam ibaaha tọọñọ awo aketọọñọ aba ke ederimbod; akedo akop akpaaña nsa. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Ekamba abio ado amaasakka ke mbaak ita, mme abio ke mme idịd mme idịd emaenyʌñ ewuuro. Abasi amaatoiyo Babilọn ekamba abio, anyʌñ anọ anye kọọb a-ayọhọke ye ukọd akpọsọñ ifiobesịd amọ. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Afịd mme isuọ emaefeeñe, awo ikikanna ikịt mme ikpọabod aba. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Mme edịm itiad e-ekedoppoke eyọhọ ñkpọ nte baun ikie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 45</char></note> emaeto ikpaanyọñ ediduọññọ etọọñ mme awo. Ndin ammọ emaesueñ Abasi ke ntak unọmọ edịm itiad ado, sia unọmọ ado amaanie ndịk eti-eti.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s1">Awonwaan Akpara ye Idiọọk Unam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Keed ke atu mme enyere itiaba e-ekekamake bọwịd itiaba amaadi adimbo miin ate, “Di, ke ñyaakuwọt fiin ufen ekamba akpara ado, anye a-atieghe ke mben uwak mmọọñ. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Mme ndidem ederimbod emaesịn efịbe ye anye, ndin ukọd efịbe amọ amaanaam mme andidʌñ ke isọñ.”<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Ndin enyere amaamben miin ke Sịbidịd asio akaa ke anaan. Ndin mmaakịt awonwaan naña atie ke anyọñ ndad-ndad idiọọk unam e-ekefʌkkọ anye ye mme anyịñ e-ekedooho nsueñ enọ Abasi, akenyʌññọ anie iwuod itiaba ye nnʌk duob. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Afọñ a-awonwaan ado akesịneke akedo iduod-iduod ye ndad-ndad, akenyʌñ asesem ye kold, ye nsọñudua itiad ye ñkwa. Anye amaakama kọọb kold ke ubọk amọ a-akeyọhọke ye mbubiam ñkpọ ye mbad efịbe amọ. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Emaewet ndedịbe anyịñ ami ke akpọiso amọ:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">
    <char style="sc">ekamba Babilọn</char></para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">
    <char style="sc">andido Eka mme Akpara</char></para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">
    <char style="sc">ye mme ñkpọ Mbubiam Ederimbod.</char><verse eid="REV 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Ami mmaakịt ke iyiib ndisana ikọd Abasi amaanaam awonwaan ami, iyiib mbon e-eketieghe ntiense enọ Yisọs.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Ke mmaakekịt anye, idem amañkpa eti-eti. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Ndin enyere ado amambo: “Nsoo inam nọ idem ukpa fiin ntom? Ami ñyaanam ndedịbe ñkpọ a-abañake awonwaan ami ye idiọọk unam a-anye awatta a-anieghe iwuod itiaba ye nnʌk duob unwaña fiin. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Idiọọk unam a-afo akekịtte, a-amaakebaba ini keed koo, ado ibaaha aba idahami, ndin ayaawuọ ato Abis adikisoobo ye nsobo amọ. Mbon e-edʌñọke ke ederimbod a-anyịñ ammọ imiiwereke ke ñwed uwem tọọñọ ke aditọọñọ ederimbod eyaeba ke ataa ñkpaidem ke ini ammọ ediikịt idiọọk unam ado, sia ini keed anye amaaba, idahami anye ibaaha, ado ayaamaana adi.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />“Ñkpọ ami ayem iwuod aniọñ. Iwuod itiaba ado edoñño mme abod itiaba a-awonwaan ami atieghe. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Ammọ enyʌñ edoñño ndidem itiaba. Ition e-eduọññọ, keed mmọdo, anye ako idiighe diin; ado anye amaadi, ana anye aba ke etək-etək ini. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Idiọọk unam ado a-akebaaha ini keed koo, i-imiibaaha idahami aba, ado ayọhọ adidem itiaita. Anye asịne ke atu itiaba ado ndin asʌk aka nsobo amọ.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />“Mme nnʌk duob a-afo akekịtte edoñño ndidem duob i-imiibọọhọ mme abioubọọñ ammọ diin, ado eyaebọ adudu adikara nte ndidem ye idiọọk unam ke awa keed. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Ammọ enie uduak keed, ndin eyaeyaak adudu ye ukara ammọ enọ idiọọk unam. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Ammọ eyaenwana ekọñ ye Ayịn Edọñ, ado Ayịn Edọñ ayaakan ammọ, sia anye ado Abọọñ mme mbọọñ ye Adidem mme ndidem, ndin mbon e-emaekekoot, emek, mme anam akpanikọ enyʌñ edoñño mme mbed e-ebuọttọ idem ye anye eyaeba ye anye.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Ndin enyere amambo miin, “Mme akpa mmọọñ a-afo akekịtte naña akpara ado atie edoñño mme awo, atu awo, mme idịd ye mme usem. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Idiọọk unam ado ye nnʌk duob ado eyaesua akpara ado. Ammọ eyaesobo anye enyʌñ esuuk anye ifed; eyaeta abʌkidem amọ enyʌñ efọp anye ke ikañ. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Sia Abasi a-asịn ke esịd ammọ ate ammọ enam uduak amọ ema ke adinyịmme adinọ idiọọk unam ado adudu adikara tutu ikọ Abasi adisu. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Awonwaan a-afo akekịtte do ado ekamba abio a-akarake mme ndidem ederimbod.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s1">Iduọ Babilọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Ke ami amaakeboiyo, ami mmaakịt enyere mfen naña asọiyọ ato hefịn adi. Anye amaanie akpọsọñ adudu, ndin ederimbod amaayamma ato ke ntak uyai amọ. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Anye amaabọñ ke akpọsọñ uyio ate:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">“ ‘A-aduọ! Ekamba Babilọn a-aduọ!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">Anye adido itie idʌñ mme dimọn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">ye itie mme mbubiam sịbidịd esikibonoke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">itie mme afịd ndedeghe inuen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">mme ndedeghe ye mbubiam unam esikibonoke.<verse eid="REV 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Sia afịd mme idịd e-enwọñ akpọsọñ ukọd efịbe amọ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">Ndidem ederimbod emaesịn efịbe ye anye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">ndin ñkpoon mme anyam udua ke ederimbod</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">emaekappa emọinyọ ato ke uwak ñkpọ udia uwem amọ.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndʌdutọñ Adifeghe Mbọkkọ Ubiereikpe Babilọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Ndin ami mmaakop naña uyio mfen ato hefịn abo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">“ ‘Ikọd mmi, iwuọñọ ikpọñ anye,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">mbaak ndufo idikeene iwuana ke mme ndiọiñkpọ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">mbaak ndufo idinyʌñ ibọọ mme unọmọ amọ ndomokeed;<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />sia mme ndiọiñkpọ amọ edọọk ekesịm hefịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">ndin Abasi a-atoiyo mme mbubịk amọ.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Itịmme inọ anye ukem se anye akenọọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">ikpe anye ukpa iba se anye akenam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">Tọkkọ nọ anye ke udomo kọọb amọ akañ iba.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Nọ anye akpọsọñ ndutʌhọ ye mfʌhọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">yak akem ye ubọọñ ye eduek uwem se anye akenọọ idem amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Ke esịd amọ anye asʌk awọk inua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">‘Ami ntie ke ebekpo nte abọọñanwaan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Ami ndooho ebekpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">ami ndiinyʌññọ mba ke mfʌhọ.’<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Ke ntoro, ke usen keed mme unọmọ amọ eyaekan anye ubọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">ñkpa, mfʌhọ ye akañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Ikañ ayaata anye asobo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">sia Abọọñ Abasi andibiide ikpe nnọọ anye ado andikpon ñkan.<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsobo Ita Asịmme Babilọn ke Iduọ Amọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />“Ke ini ndidem ederimbod e-ekesịnne efịbe ye anye, e-ekenyʌññọ ewuana ke mme ñkpọuto udia uwem amọ ediikịt nsʌñikañ a-afọppọ anye, ammọ eyaetua enyʌñ efʌhọ ke ntak amọ. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Ke akpọsọñ ndịk adiinam ammọ adikịt ndutʌhọ amọ, ammọ eyaeda nsan-nsan etua:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">“ ‘Nsobo! Nsobo unie fiin, ekamba abio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">afo Babilọn, akop adudu abio!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">Ke idak awa keed, ikpe nsobo mfo a-adi!’<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />“Ikpọ mme anyamudua ederimbod eyaetua enyʌñ efʌhọ anye sia awo ndomokeed ideppe mme ñkpọ udua ammọ aba, <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />mme ñkpọ udua kold, silfa, nsọñudua itiad ye mme ñkwa; mfọọn linen, iduod-iduod, sịlk ye ndad-ndad afọñ; afịd utọ eto sitrọn, ye mme nsio-nsio ñkpọ e-edatta nnʌk eniin enam, nsọñudua eto, brọns, ukwak ye mabịd; <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />mme ñkpọ udua sinamọn ye spaisi, insensi, mee, frañkinsensi, ukọd ye adan ọlif, ndọdọrọ ndomuyo ye abakpa; mme enañ ye edọñ; enañmbakara ye ukpadñkpọ; ye mme awo enyamma nte ifʌn.<verse eid="REV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />“Ammọ eyaebo, ‘Mfịd a-afo akeyemme u-ukpọñ fiin. Afịd inie ye mmọnyọ mfo e-esoomo, idiitịmmeke ubịne aba. <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Mme ñwuọnda anyam udua e-ekesinyamma mme ñkpọudua enyʌñ enam inie ammọ eto anye, ediidada ke anyan usʌñ ise anye, ekop ndịk ke ukuud amọ. Ammọ eyaetua enyʌñ efʌhọ, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />ndin ebọọñ ke akpọsọñ uyio ete:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">“ ‘Nsobo! Nsobo unie fiin, akpọsọñ abio a-akesisịneke linen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">iduod-iduod ye ndad-ndad anyʌñ asesem ye kold ye nsọñudua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">itiad ye mme ñkwa.<verse eid="REV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Ke awa keed kpọd ekamba inie ado adʌk nsobo!’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">“Afịd mme awadinyañ ye afịd mme andisika isañ ke nsʌñikañ, mme awat nsʌñikañ, mme afịd mbon uyem idịb udia nto mmọọñ eyaeda nsan-nsan. <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />Ke ini ammọ ekịtte nsʌñikañ a-awuọhọ ke ikañ a-afọppọ anye, ammọ eyaesio ñkpọ ete, ‘Kpaanaanam me aba abio nte utọ akpọsọñ abio ami?’ <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Ammọ eyaeduọk ntọñ ke mme iwuod ammọ, ndin ke ntuaña ye mfʌhọ eyaebọñ ñkpo ebo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">“ ‘Nsobo! Nsobo unie fiin, akpọsọñ abio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">itie a-afịd mbon se ikinie mme ubom ke akpa mmọọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">e-ekemọinyọke ato ke ntak imọ amọ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">Ke awa keed nsobo a-asịm anye!’<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />“Inem esịd ibaña anye, ndufo mme hefịn!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">Inem esịd, ndufo ikọd Abasi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">Inem esịd, mme abọsịd ye mme prọfed!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">Sia Abasi a-akpe ikpe amọ ye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">ubiideikpe a-anye akebenne idot ndufo!”<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpatre Nsobo Babilọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Ndin ataa akop adudu enyere keed amaabenne ekamba itiad a-akekponno nte ekamba itiad ukọkñkpọ atop asịn ke akpainyañ anyʌñ abo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">“Ke utọ afai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">ami ke ediitop Babilọn iduọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">ndin awo ndomokeed idiikịtte anye aba.<verse eid="REV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Awo idiikoppo aba uto fiin ikwọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">mme abre ndido ye mme akwọikwọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">mme afịdadʌk ye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">mme afịd adukpoñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">Awo idiikịtte mme anam utom usọ ke akwere mfo aba. Awo idiinyʌññọ ikop</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">uyom ukọkñkpọ uto fiin aba.<verse eid="REV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Awo idiinyʌññọ ikịt aba unwana ikañ a-atooho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">utuenikañ naña ayamma uto fiin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">awo idiikoppo uyio ebendọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">ye anwaan ndọ aba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Mme anyam udua mfo ekewuọ etob ekan afịd awo ke ederimbod.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">Ato ke ntak mme ifọd mfo afịd mme idịd emaewakka ekpọñ usʌñ.<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Ke idem amọ emaekịt iyiib mme prọfed ye ake mme ndisana ikọd Abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:24">ye ake afịd awo se ekewoot ke ederimbod.”<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ñkpoyo Idaara ke Hefịn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Ke ami amaakeboiyo, ami mmaakop se ikiba nte uyom ekamba atu awo ke hefịn naña ebọñ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">“Haleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">Adinyaaña ye ubọọñ ye adudu enie Abasi ñnyịn,<verse eid="REV 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />sia mme ubiideikpe amọ edo ke unen ye akpanikọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Anye a-abiom ekamba akpara ado ikpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">anye a-akebiamma ederimbod ke efịbe amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Anye a-asio akpara ado usiene ke iyiib mme isʌñutom amọ.”<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Ndin ammọ emaemaana ebọñ ñkpo ete:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">“Haleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">Nsʌñikañ a-atooho anye adọọk aka ke nsi-nsi nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="REV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Mme ñkpisọñ edịb mme inaañ ado, ye mme aduuwem unam ado emaeduọññọ ke isọñ ekpono Abasi, a-aketieghe ke ebekpo. Ndin enyʌñ ebọñ ete:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:4">“Amen, Haleluya!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Ndin uyio amaato ebekpo ate:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">“Itooro Abasi ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">afịd ndufo mme isʌñutom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">ndufo e-efegheke anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">ntək-ntək mme ñkpoon!”<verse eid="REV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Ndin mmaakop se ikiba nte ekamba atu awo, nte uyom adufuud mmọọñ ye nte nsakka uwak aduma, naña ebo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">“Haleluya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:6">Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Andikponñkan akara.<verse eid="REV 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Yak ñnyịn idaara, inyʌñ inem esịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">inyʌñ inọ anye ubọọñ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">Sia ini ndọ Ayịn Edọñ a-adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">ndin anwaan ndọ abeeñe idem.<verse eid="REV 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Emaenọ anye uyaiya nsem-nsem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:8">ye nsana linen asịne”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 19:8">(Uyaiya linen ada anọ ndinen utom mme ndisana ikọd Abasi.)<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Ndin enyere amambo miin ate, “Wet: Afọfọn anọ mbon e-ekoodo ebo edi usọrọ ndọ Ayịn Edọñ!” Amaanyʌñ adian do ate “Mbon ami edoñño mme ikọ akpanikọ Abasi.”<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Ke emaeketañ ami, ami mmaaduọ anye ke ukod adikpono anye, ado anye amambo miin ate: “Kuunam ntoro! Ami ndo emọ-emọ isʌñutom nte afo ye nditọeka mfo ke Krais e-emʌmmọ ikọ ntiense Yisọs ekama. Ikpono Abasi! Sia Sịbidịd brọfesi ado se itie ntiense inọ Yisọs.”<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Krais ke Anyọñ Afia Enañmbakara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Mmaakịt hefịn naña ana inwañ, ndin ke iso mmi afia enañmbakara amaada, ekoot andiwad anye Nsọọñọnda ye Akpanikọ. Ke unen ke anye akpe ikpe anyʌñ anwana ekọñ. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Anyen amọ asak nte ndubek ikañ, anye anyʌñ ayara uwak anyanya ke iwuod. Anye anie anyịñ e-ewette anye ke idem a-adooho awo ndomokeed mfen idiọọñọke ibọhọke anye ke idem amọ kpọd. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Anye asịne afọñ e-ekenyiine ke iyiib, ndin anyịñ amọ ado Ikọ Abasi. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Mme udịmekọñ hefịn emaekeene anye, ewat ke anyọñ mfia enañmbakara enyʌñ esiine mfọọn linen, mfia ye nsaana. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Akañkañ a-asọppọ afịbe anye ke inua nọ anye adat asobo mme idịd. “Anye ayaakara ammọ ye esañ ukwak.” Anye ado andidioho unuak ukọd iyadesịd ye ifiobesịd Abasi Andikponñkan. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />E-ewet anyịñ amọ ke afọñidem amọ ye ke ifʌkkọ amọ:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 19:16">
    <char style="sc">Adidem mme Ndidem ye Abọọñ mme Mbọọñ.</char><verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Ndin ami mmaakịt enyere naña ada ke utịn, a-akebọññọ ke akpọsọñ uyio anọ afịd mme inuen se ifuurọ ke ufọọd anyọñ: “Idi, idiboho itie keed ke ekamba usọrọ udia Abọọñ Abasi, <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />nọ ndufo eta abʌk mme ndidem, ikpọ mbon ekọñ, ye mme awo e-ekoppo adudu, mme enañmbakara ye mme andiwad ammọ, mme abʌkidem afịd awo, amanaisọñ ye ifʌn, ntək-ntək ye ñkpoon.”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Ndin mmaakịt idiọọk unam ye mme adaukara ederimbod ye mbon ekọñ ammọ naña ebono itie keed adinwana ekọñ ye andiwad afia enañmbakara ye mbon ekọñ amọ. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Ado emaemʌm idiọọk unam ado, ye prọfed abiaña a-akesinamma mme utịppe idiọọñọ ke iwuod amọ. Mme idiọọñọ ado ke anye akesikama ayaañ mbon e-ekebọọhọ idiọọñọ idiọọk unam enyʌñ ekpono mbid amọ. Emaetoomo ammọ awo iba edọñ ke ibiok ikañ sọlfọ. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Emaewoot mbon se ikisʌhọ ke akañkañ a-akewuọhọ ke inua andikiwat enañmbakara, ndin afịd mme inuen emaeyʌkkọ ato ke adita abʌk ammọ.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ebọp Setan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Ndin ami mmaakịt enyere naña asọiyọ ato hefịn adi, anyʌñ akama ukpọhọde Abis ye ekamba ñkpọnọ ke ubọk amọ. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Anye amaamʌm drakọn, akaan udʌkikọd ado, a-adooho andidiọọk, me Setan, anyʌñ akọp anye ke isua tọsịn keed. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Anye amaatop anye asịn ke Abis, ayịt usʌñ anyʌñ afiik ke ufiikñkpọ, mbaak anye adibiaña mme idịd aba tutu mme isua tọsịn keed ado adikem. Ini ado amaaboiyo, ana etat anye eyaak ke etək-etək ini.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Ami mmaakịt mme ebekpo a-mbon e-emaekenọ adudu adibiide ikpe eketieghe. Ndin mmaakịt ukpọñ mbon e-ekekpịkkeke iwuod ke ntak aditie ntiense nnọ Yisọs ye ikọ Abasi. Ammọ ikikponoke idiọọk unam ye mbid amọ, ikinyʌññọ ibọ idiọọñọ ke akpọiso me ke ubọk ammọ. Ammọ emaeseet ke ñkpa ndin emaedu uwem enyʌñ ekeene Krais eda ukara ke isua tọsịn keed. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />(Mbon se ikisʌhọ ke atu mme akpañkpa ikisette idu uwem aba tutu ke isua tọsịn keed ado emaekeboiyo.) Ami ado akpa adised ke ñkpa. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Afọfọn anọ mbon e-enieghe udeeme ke akpa adised ke ñkpa. Ñkpa ayọhọ iba inieghe adudu ke idem ammọ, ado ammọ ediidoñño mme ndisana aku Abasi ye ake Krais, ndin ammọ eyaekeene anye eda ukara ke isua tọsịn keed.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubiere Ikpe Setan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Ke mme tọsịn isua keed ado emaeboiyo, eyaesio Setan ke ñkpakọb amọ, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />ndin anye ayaawuọ akebiaña mme idịd ke mbeñ inaañ ederimbod, Kọk ye Makọk, adikoono ammọ mbon itie keed nọ enwana ekọñ. Ke ibad, ammọ ewak nte ntan ke mben inyañ. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Ammọ emaesaaña ke afịd ukpa ederimbod enyʌñ ekanna itie idʌñ ndisana nditọ Abasi ekʌk, abio a-anye amaaha. Ado ikañ amaato hefịn adita ammọ akwaat. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Ndin emaetop Setan a-akebiañake ammọ esịn ke ibiok ikañ sọlfọ e-emaeketotop idiọọk unam ado ye prọfed abiaña esịn. Eyaetʌkkọ ammọ uweemeayio ye akonayio ke nsi-nsi nsi-nsi.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubiereikpe mme Akpañkpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Ndin mmaakịt ataa ekamba afia ebekpo ye awo andikitie ke anye. Isọñ ye mme hefịn emaefeeñe ekpọñ iso amọ, ndin itie ikibaaha inọ ammọ. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Ndin ami mmaakịt mbon e-emaekekpañña, ñkpoon ye ntək, naña eda ke iso ebekpo, emaenyʌñ ekuumọ mme ñwed. Emaekʌppọ ñwed mfen a-adooho ñwed uwem. Emaekpe ikpe enọ mbon e-emaekekpañña akeene se ammọ ekenañña naña ekewet esịn ke ñwed. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Akpainyañ amaasaana mme akpañkpa se ikisịne anye ke esịd ayaak, ndin ñkpa ye Abioekpo emaesaana mme akpañkpa se ikisịne ammọ ke esịd eyaak, ndin emaebiere ikpe enọ awo keedekeed akeene se ammọ ekenam. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Ndin emaetop ñkpa ye Abioekpo esịn ke ibiok ikañ. Ibiok ikañ ado ñkpa ayọhọ iba. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Awo keed akeedodo a-anyịñ amọ imiikiwereke ke ñwed uwem, emaetop esịn ke ibiok ikañ ado.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ufa Hefịn ye Ufa Ederimbod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Ndin mmaakịt ufa hefịn ye ufa ederimbod, sia akpa hefịn ye akpa ederimbod emaeboiyo efep, ndin akpainyañ ikibaaha aba. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Ami mmaakịt Adisana Abio, ufa Yeruselem, naña awuọ ke hefịn ato Abasi adi, emaebeeñe anye idem nte ufa anwaan ndọ a-amaakesịne uyaiya afọn abeeñe idem abet ebendọ. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Ndin mmaakop ekamba uyio a-aketooho ebekpo naña abo, “Se, idahami itie idʌñ Abasi aba ye mme awo, anye ayaadʌñ ye ammọ. Ammọ eyaedoñño mbon amọ, ndin Abasi ke idem amọ ayaadʌñ ye ammọ, anyʌñ ado Abasi ammọ. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Anye ayaakwokko mmọọñayịd asio ammọ ke anyen. Ñkpa me mfʌhọ me ayịd me ubiak idiibaaha aba, sia ñkaan edu unañña ñkpọ emaeboiyo ifep.”<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Anye a-aketieghe ke ebekpo amaabo, “Ami mmenam afịd ñkpọ ado ufa!” Ndin anye ate, “Wet ñkpọ ami nịm sia mme ikọ ami e-edot se enịm ke akpanikọ, enyʌñ edo akpanikọ.”<verse eid="REV 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Anye amambo miin ate: “E-enam ema. Ami ndo Alfa ye Omeka, Ntọọñọ ye Utịd. Awo i-itọñ asatta, ami ñyaanọ anye mmọọñ a-atooho idịm mmọọñ uwem anwọñ ke mfọn, mbọọhọ akʌk. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Mbon e-ekanna eyaeben afịd ñkpọ ami enie, ndin Ami ñyaado Abasi ammọ, ammọ eyaedo nditọ mmi. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Ado mme mbon nduen, mbon imiinịmme ke akpanikọ, mbon mbubiam, mme awodawo, mme asịn efịbe ye mme asaña akpara, mme anam utom mayịk, mme akpono ndem ye afịd mme asʌhọ nsu, itie ammọ adiido ke ibiok ikañ sọlfọ. Anye ami ado ayọhọ ñkpa iba.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ufa Yeruselem Ado Anwaan Ndọ Ayịn Edọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Keed ke atu mme enyere itiaba e-ekekamake mme bọwịd e-ekeyọhọke ye mme akpatre unọmọ itiaba ado amaadimbo miin ate: “Di, yak uwọt fiin ufa anwaan ndọ, anwaan Ayịn Edọñ.” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Ndin anye amamben miin ke Sịbidịd awuọ akaa ekamba ñkoñ-ñkoñ abod akeñwọt miin Adisana Abio, Yeruselem, akewuọhọ ke hefịn ato Abasi adi. <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />Anye amaayamma ye ntak ubọọñ Abasi, akenyʌñ asesem nte nsọñudua yuwel, nte yaspa, asana nte kristal. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Anye akenie ekamba anyan ndibene e-ekesioho inuaatob duob mme iba. Mme enyere duob mme iba emaenyʌñ eda ke mme inuaatob ado. Ke mme inuaatob ado emaeweet mme anyịñ esiin Isrel duob mme iba. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Mme inuaatob ita ekeba ke usakkautịn, ita ke adoro, ita ke usuuk, ye ita ke usobutịn. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Ndibene abio ado akenie itiad idakisọñ duob mme iba, ndin ke idem ammọ emaeweet anyịñ mme abọsịd Ayịn Edọñ duob mme iba.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Enyere andikitañ ikọ ye ami amaakama esañ udomoñkpọ kold adidomo abio ado ye mme inuaatob ye ndibene amọ. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Ekebọp abio ado nọ mbañ amọ inaañ edoñño ukem-ukem, unyọọñ amọ akedo ukem ye ubom amọ. Anye amaadomo abio ado ye esañ udomoñkpọ anyʌñ akịt ke akedo tọsịn duob mme iba (12,000) ke unyọọñ;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte itiad 1,400 me kilomita 2,200</char></note> ubom amọ ye ukoñ ekenyʌñ edo ukem. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Enyere ado amaadomo ndibene ke udomo a-mme awo ekamake anyʌñ akịt ke akedoppo kubid ikie mme aba mme inaañ (144).<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 200 me mita 65</char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Ekenam ndibene ke yaspa, abio ke idem amọ ekebọp ke ataa eti kold a-akesemme nte akraasi. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Ekedat afịd nsio-nsio nsọñudua itiad ediọñ mme itiad idakisọñ ndibene abio ado. Akpa itiad idakisọñ akedo yaspa, ayọhọ iba akedo safaiya, ayọhọ ita akedo akate, ayọhọ inaañ emeraal, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />ayọhọ ition ọniks, ayọhọ itiokeed rubi, ayọhọ itiaba krisolaid, ayọhọ itiaita beril, ayọhọ usʌkkeed topas, ayọhọ duob tọkwọis, ayọhọ duob mme keed yasịn, ayọhọ duob mme iba ametis. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Mme inuaatob duob mme iba ado ekedoñño nsọñudua itiad duob mme iba. Ekedat nsọñudua mme enam mme inuaatob ado keedekeed. Ekekama ataa adeghe kold a-akesemme nte akraasi a-adooho se edat ekịt iso, enam ekamba akpọusʌñ abio ado.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Ami ñkekịtte tembịd ke abio ado sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Andikponñkan ye Ayịn Edọñ edo tembịd amọ. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Abio ado iyemme utịn me afiọñ adiyamma ke anye, sia ubọọñ Abasi anọ anye unwana, ndin Ayịn Edọñ ado utuenikañ amọ. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Mme idịd ediisaña ke unwana amọ, ndin mme ndidem ederimbod eyaeben ubọọñ ammọ edʌk ke esịd amọ. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Ibaaha usen ndomokeed ediibet inuaatob amọ sia akonayio idiibaaha do. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Eyaeben ubọọñ ye ukpono mme idịd edʌk edi do. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Ñkpọ ndomokeed i-imiisanake me mbubiam ñkpọ idiidʌkkọ do, ñko awo ndomokeed a-anamma ñkpọ abuud me ñkara idiidʌkkọ do, ibọhọke mbon e-ewette anyịñ ammọ esịn ke ñwed uwem Ayịn Edọñ.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="s1">Idịm Mmọọñ Uwem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Ndin enyere amañwọt miin inyañ mmọọñ uwem, a-asanake nte kristal, a-afegheke ato ebekpo Abasi ye ake Ayịn Edọñ <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />adiwuọ ufọọd ekamba usʌñ abio ado. Ke mbeñ iba inyañ ado eto uwem amaada a-akeyịreke ayọ mfịd duob mme iba, anyʌñ asio mfịd afịd afiọñ. Ndin mme mfañ eto ado, ado se edat ekọk mme idịd udọñọ. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Nsueñ ndomokeed idiibaaha aba. Ebekpo Abasi ye ake Ayịn Edọñ ediiba ke abio ado, ndin mme isʌñutom amọ eyaenam ñkpọ ekpono anye. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Ammọ eyaekịt anye iso, ndin anyịñ amọ ayaawere ammọ ke akpọiso. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Akonayio idiibaaha aba, ammọ idiiyemme unwana utuenikañ me unwana utịn, sia Abọọñ Abasi ayaanọ ammọ unwana. Ndin ammọ eyaeda ukara ke nsi-nsi nsi-nsi.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yọọn ye Enyere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Enyere amambo miin, “Mme ikọ ami a-adot se enịm ke akpanikọ anyʌñ ado akpanikọ. Abọọñ, Abasi a-anọọhọ mme prọfed ifiọk, amaadọñ enyere amọ akewọt mme isʌñutom amọ mme ñkpọ a-anaaha asọp atịppe.”<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />
    <char style="wj">“Sese, Ami nsʌk nsọp ndi! Afọfọn anọ awo a-anịmme mme ikọ brọfesi a-adọñọke ke ikpañwed ami.”</char><verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Ami Yọọn, ami ndo andikikop ñnyʌñ ñkịt mme ñkpọ ami. Ndin ke ami mmaakekop ñnyʌñ ñkịt ammọ, ami mmaaduọ ke isọñ ke ukod enyere ado adikpono anye a-akeñwọttọ miin mme ñkpọ ami. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Ado anye amambo miin: “Kuunam ntoro! Ami ndo emọ-emọ isʌñutom ye afo ye mme emọ-emọ prọfed ye afịd mbon e-enịmme mme ikọ ñwed ami. Kpono Abasi.”<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Ndin anye amambo miin: “Kuusiit ikọ brọfesi ñwed ami sia ini akpere. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Yak andinam idiọọk akaiso anam idiọọk; yak awo mbubiam akaiso ado mbubiam; yak andinam adinen ido akaiso anam adinen ido; ndin yak adisana awo akaiso ado adisana.”<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Akpatre Ikọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />
    <char style="wj">“Sese, ami nsʌk nsọp ndi! Utịb mmi mmọdo ye ami, ndin ñyaanọ awo keedekeed akeene se ammọ enam.</char> <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" /><char style="wj">Ami ndo Alfa ye Omeka, Akpa ye Akpatre, Ntọọñọ ye Utịd.</char><verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />
    <char style="wj">“Afọfọn anọ mbon e-eyette afọñ ammọ, nọ ammọ ediinie unen ke eto uwem, enyʌñ eboiyo ke inuaatob edʌk esịd abio.</char> <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" /><char style="wj">Ke esiin mme ewa ebañña, mme anam mayịk, mme asịn efịbe, mme asaña use, mme awodawo, mme akpono ndem ye afịd awo se ima inyʌñ inam nsu-nsu uwem.</char><verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />
    <char style="wj">“Ami, Yisọs, mmedọñ enyere Mmi adunọ fiin</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">22:16 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek ado uwak.</char>
    </note> <char style="wj">mme ikọ ntiense ami esọk mme ufọkabasi. Ami ndo Adʌñ ye Ntịppe Defid, ye ñyayamma Ntantaafiọñ Ubakusen.”</char><verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Sịbidịd ye ufa anwaan ndọ ete, “Di!” Ndin yak anye a-akoppo abo, “Di!” Awo akeedodo i-itọñ asatta, yak anye adi. Ñko awo a-amaaha, yak anye adibọ enọ mfọn mmọọñ uwem.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Ami mmedʌt afịd awo se ikop mme ikọ brọfesi ñwed ami utọñ. Awo akeedodo akpedian ñkpọ ndomokeed ke mme ikọ ami, Abasi ayaadian mme unọmọ e-etañña ebaña ke ñwed ami anọ anye. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Ndin adieke awo ndomokeed asioho ikọ ndomokeed afep ke ñwed brọfesi ami, Abasi ayaasio udeeme amọ afep ke eto uwem ye ke Adisana Abio, e-etañña ebaña ke ñwed ami.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Anye a-atañña mme ikọ ntiense ami abo, <char style="wj">“Ii, Ami nsʌk nsọp ndi.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Amen. Di, Abọọñ Yisọs.<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Yak mfọn Abọọñ Yisọs aba ye nditọ Abasi. Amen.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>